<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">MIG - Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Mig</para>
  <para style="toc2">Migani</para>
  <para style="toc1">EMIGANI</para>
  <para style="h">Emigani</para>
  <para style="mt1">EMIGANI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="ip">Ecitabu c’Emigani lwo lwîganyo lwinja bwenêne omu bitabu by’obumanye. Eco citabu cibâmwo enyigîrizo z’amango ga ngasi lubero, ga mîra. Ecigabi ca mîra bwenene cibâmwo bihimbi bibirhi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 10-22">10—22</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25-29">25—29</ref></char>) byàyandikagwa na Salomoni. Ye walolagwa ensiku zoshi nka muntu mwîrhonzi kulusha abantu b’omu Israheli boshi. Cibâmwo n’eyindi migani yayandikagwa n’abandi bantu bashi- nganyanya na bîrhonzi; ci amazîno gabo garhadesirwi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 22:17-24:34">22, 17—24, 34</ref></char>). Ecitabu c’Emigani cifundisirwe n’enyimbo z’okukuza omukazi mutagatîfu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 31:10-31">31, 10-31</ref></char>). Eci citabu ciyigîriza oku Nyamuzinda ahêmba obwôrhere bwinja bw’okuli, obuzigire, obucêse bw’iroho n’obwîrhôhye. Ci kwône anahane ngasi bijiro bibi bilwîsa obwo bwinja. Obwo bwîrhonzi kuli kuderha kurhi? Kuli kukenga Nyamuzinda n’okumuyegemera yênène. Rhwanâbone Obwîrhonzi bucîderhera n’okucîkuza nka bwâgo bwâgo. Bwîrhonzi bwa bene obwo buli bwa bumvîkane ekarhî kabwo bwône haguma na Nyamuzinda kurhenga ensiku zoshi, bwàrhabîre Nyamuzinda okulema igulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 8:22-31">8, 22-31</ref></char>). Bwo burhanzi rhwabona omu Bibliya ebyo binwa byarhôla obwîrhonzi nka muntu nkana. Buzira kuhabuka ciru n’ehitya, enyigîrizo z’eyo migani zirhalushiri ezi rhwàhâbirwe na Yezu Kristu, bulya ye «Bwîrhonzi bwa Nyamuzinda». Rhurhayibagiraga kandi oku idini ly’okunali lirhankaj’enyanya n’okuhimana nka lirhayimangîri oku muntu mukengwa. Liguma liguma Endagâno Mpyâhya ekolêsa emigani ya muli eco citabu. Co cirhumire ngasi mukristu ayumvîrhize anakenge ezo ngerêrezo z’abîrhonzi b’omu Israheli ba mîra.</para>
  <para style="iot">EBIRIMWO</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mahano g’oburhimanya: cigabi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PRO 1:1-9:18">1, 1—9, 18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Emigani mikulu ya Salomoni: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="PRO 10:1-22:16">10, 1—22, 16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Emigani y’abandi birhonzi: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="PRO 22:17-24:22">22, 17—24, 22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Eyindi migani y’abanya-bwenge bunji: c. <char style="ior"><ref loc="PRO 24:23-34">24, 23-34</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PRO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Izîno ly’ecitabu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 1:1"/>Migani ya Salomoni, mwene Daudi, mwâmi w’Israheli:<verse eid="PRO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 1:2"/>oku kumanya oburhimanya n’ihano, oku kuyumva bwinjà ebinwa bizibu;<verse eid="PRO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 1:3"/>oku kumanya abîgîrizibwa n’abalenga, okushinganyanya, okubà ntagengwa n’okurhondêza;<verse eid="PRO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 1:4"/>okuhêreza abagûnda obulenga, n’omwâna w’obusole obumanye n’obulenga bw’amakengu.<verse eid="PRO 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 1:5"/>Omurhimanya ayumve, anayûshûlemwo obulenga bwâge, n’omuntu mukengwa akûlemwo obulenga bw’okurhegeka;<verse eid="PRO 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 1:6"/>amanyiyumva ebinwa bizibu n’emigani, ebinwa by’abarhimanya n’emigani yâbo.<verse eid="PRO 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 1:7"/>Okurhînya Nyamuzinda, gwo murhondêro gw’oburhimanya, basirhe bwo barhakwirirwa burhimanya, barhakwirirwa n’ihano.<verse eid="PRO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Enshula-mwanzi: Amahano gw'oburhimanya</para>
  <para style="s1">Omurhimanya kuyâka ayâka abîra babî</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 1:8"/>Yumva mwâna wâni, ihano lya sho, orhahîraga okagaya akanwa nyoko akubwîra,<verse eid="PRO 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 1:9"/>ciri cimanè ca kukwânana irhwe lyâwe, gali magerha omu igosi lyâwe.<verse eid="PRO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 1:10"/>Mwâna wâni, erhi abanya-byâha bakâlonza okukushumika, orhayêmêraga!<verse eid="PRO 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 1:11"/>Erhi bakakubwîra mpu: «oyîshe rhugende rhweshi, rhucîbundike rhubulage omukò buzira igwârhiro, rhucîfulike rhulinge omwêru-kwêru:<verse eid="PRO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 1:12"/>mpu rhubamiranguse kula okuzimu kunajira, rhubamire baguma-guma nka kula banayandagalira omu nshinda.<verse eid="PRO 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 1:13"/>Mpu rhwabona ebinja-binji, enyumpa zîrhu rhwazibûmba munyago,<verse eid="PRO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 1:14"/>Mpu wayesha ecigole haguma nîrhu obone ogwâwe mwanya, nshoho nguma rhwakazibîkira rhweshi».<verse eid="PRO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 1:15"/>Mwâna wâni, orhahîra okabakulikira omu njira bali, oyêrekeze amagulu gâwe kuli n’enjira balimwo,<verse eid="PRO 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 1:16"/>bulyâla amagulu gâbo buhanya gayêrekîre, galibirhîre okugendibulaga omukò,<verse eid="PRO 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 1:17"/>na bulyâla kuli kurhamira busha, okulambûlira akasirha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«akarhonde karhafà oku bulêmbo» halî ebinyunyi birhegwa n’akasirha, ebindi bulya biri byênge bicîyakire bibona oku byamarhegwa.</char></note> omu masù g’akanyunyi.<verse eid="PRO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 1:18"/>Abôla bônene bacîrhega, buhanya bwâbo bayunja-yunja.<verse eid="PRO 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 1:19"/>Kwo azinda ali ntyo oli magene gw’okuzimba, amagene kuyisa gayisa oyu gamahândira.<verse eid="PRO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuyumva amahano g’oburhimanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 1:20"/>Oburhimanya budwîrhe bwayâkûliza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Burhimanya kwo adesire nka muntu, nka mulêbi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:2">Yer 7, 2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:1">5, 1</ref></char>).</char></note> omu njira, bulengezize izù omu ngo ziri emuhânda.<verse eid="PRO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 1:21"/>Aha mashanga-njira kuhamagala budwîrhe bwahamagala, aha nyumvi z’olugô<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olugô lwa mîra e Bulaya n’e Buyahudi, lwalikwo ecôgo cizibu.</char></note>, bugwêrhe emyanzi.<verse eid="PRO 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 1:22"/>Mpu «mmangaci mwaleka obuhwinja bwinyu ebi bingolo-ngolo? Na ba-cinya-masheka kuhika mangaci erhi bâsheka? N’abahwinja, kuhika mangaci erhi bayânga obumanye?<verse eid="PRO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 1:23"/>Muyêrekere amahano gâni, nkola nâmmubwîra ogûndi emurhima, nâmmumanyisa ebinwa ngwêrhe.<verse eid="PRO 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 1:24"/>Kulya kubà nahamagîre, kulya kubà nalengezize okuboko na ntâye washibirîre,<verse eid="PRO 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 1:25"/>Kulya kubà mwagayaguzize amahano gâni goshi, murhanayemiri mmubwîre,<verse eid="PRO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 1:26"/>Nâni nkola nashekera obuhanya bumulikwo, nâsheka hano mujâmwo ecikango.<verse eid="PRO 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 1:27"/>Hano entemu emurhibukira nka nkuba ya cihonzi, hano obuhanya bwinyu buyisha nka mpûsi ya kalemêra, amango ebidârhi, n’ebihamba byâmurhibukira.<verse eid="PRO 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 1:28"/>Ago mango bâmpamagala ci ntadumizè, bânnonza barhânambonè.<verse eid="PRO 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 1:29"/>Balahire obumanye, babula kwacîshoga okurhînya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PRO 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 1:30"/>Barhalonzagya ihano lyâni, bàgayire ebi nababwîraga byoshi:<verse eid="PRO 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 1:31"/>Bakolaga bâlya amalehe gw’obuhabusi bwâbo, bàyigurha amahano bàcîhaga bône.<verse eid="PRO 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 1:32"/>Bulya obuhûrha bw’omuhwinja bunamuyîrhe, n’oburhashîbirira bw’ebingolo-ngolo bunabihezè.<verse eid="PRO 1:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 1:33"/>Ci kwône onyumva yêhe âyôrha adekerîre, anarhulûle buzira kuyôboha buhanya buci».<verse eid="PRO 1:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PRO 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwîrhonzi bunalange omuntu oku bîra babî</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 2:1"/>Mwâna wâni, erhi wankayankirira ebinwa byâni, okanabîkirira amarhegeko gâni oku murhima gwâwe,<verse eid="PRO 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 2:2"/>Okanarhega oburhimanya okurhwiri, onayêrekezagye omurhima ebwa makengu.<verse eid="PRO 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 2:3"/>Nêci, erhi wankadôsa emirhima, erhi wankalakira obukengêre,<verse eid="PRO 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 2:4"/>Erhi wankabulongereza kula balongereza ensaranga erhi wankabusikimba kula bahûmba obuhirhi,<verse eid="PRO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 2:5"/>Ago mango wanayumva okurhînya Nyakasane kwo kuderha kurhi, wanabandâna okurhînya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PRO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 2:6"/>Nyamuzinda ye hâna oburhimanya, Omu kanwa kâge mwo murhenga obumanye n’obumva.<verse eid="PRO 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 2:7"/>Abashinganyanya bo abîkîre obucire bwâge, yêne ye mpenzi ya balya basêza obudahemuka,<verse eid="PRO 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 2:8"/>Yêne ye mulanzi w’enjira z’obushinganyanya, ye mulanzi w’enjira z’abemêzi bâge.<verse eid="PRO 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 2:9"/>Ago mango wanamanya kurhi omuntu ashinganyanya, Kurhi abâ ntagengwa na kurhi arhondêza! Njira za bucire ezo zoshi.<verse eid="PRO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 2:10"/>Amango omurhima gwâwe gwâjâmwo oburhimanya, n’obumanye bushagaluse omurhima gwâwe<verse eid="PRO 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 2:11"/>Ago mango, obwîrhonzi bwanakulânga, n’obumva bwânakubîka.<verse eid="PRO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 2:12"/>Kuderha mpu bakuyâse njira mbî, bakuyâse omuntu w’ebinwa by’obulyâlya,<verse eid="PRO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 2:13"/>Bakuyàse balya bakàlekêrera enjira nnungêdu; balya bajà babûnda-bûnda omu njira z’omwizimya;<verse eid="PRO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 2:14"/>Balya bayumva basîmire okukola amaligo, banunirwe n’okubêra omu mahabwe.<verse eid="PRO 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 2:15"/>Enjira zâbo zibà za binzongo-nzongo, n’emikâba bayishamwo erhabà eshongîre.<verse eid="PRO 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 2:16"/>Obwîrhonzi bwâkulanga oku mukazi w’embuga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«omukazi w’embuga» ko kuderha: mukà bene. Eci cigabi cirhanzi cishubulwire kanji kanji eryo ihano ly’okucîlanga oku bulala (sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 5:2-10">Mig 5, 2-10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:23-25">6, 23-25</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 7:5-27">7, 5-27</ref></char>)</char></note>, oku mukazi mugenzi n’oku binwa byâge by’olubohôlolo;<verse eid="PRO 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 2:17"/>Olya walesire owâbo bàkulaga bo naye, àyibagire eciragâne ca Nyamuzinda wâge.<verse eid="PRO 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 2:18"/>Enyumpa yâge ehengemire ebwa lufù, n’enjira zâge yo ziyêrekîre ebwa mpehema.<verse eid="PRO 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 2:19"/>Abajà emunda ali boshi barhalimwo ôgaluka, barhacifà bâlabasire omu njira z’akalamo.<verse eid="PRO 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 2:20"/>Ntyo kwo walambagira omu njira y’abantu nkana, kwo walanga enjira y’abashinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 2:21"/>Bulyâla abantu bashinganyanya bo bâyishirya ecihugo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eco cihugo c’Israheli eco, mw’ogu mugani. Ahâli h’okuderha olubaga lwîshogwa n’agandi mashanja, omwandisi agabire olubaga lwîshogwa mwo mpiriri ibirhi: abarhimanya n’enkola-maligo erhi entagengwa n’abaminya. </char></note>, entagengwa zo zâyishicibêramwo;<verse eid="PRO 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 2:22"/>Ci abaminya bôhe kukûlwa bayishikûlwa omu cihugo. Endyâlya kukagwa zâyishicikagwâmwo.<verse eid="PRO 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PRO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ogwêrhe oburhirnanya erhi anagwêrhe ec’agwêrhe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 3:1"/>Mwâna wâni, ebinwa nkubwîzire obibîkire emurhima, N’amarhegeko nkuhîre, ogasêze, ogahire emurhima<verse eid="PRO 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 3:2"/>Bulyâla nsiku byakuyûshûlira, n’emyâka y’akalamo n’omurhûla.<verse eid="PRO 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 3:3"/>Obukûnda-Lulema n’obudahemuka birhakujâga kulî! obiyambalire omu igosi, obiyandikire oku lwâsi lw’omurhima gwâwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 3:4"/>Wâbona oku warhona onabè n’obuhashe omu masù ga Nyamuzinda n’ag’abantu.<verse eid="PRO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 3:5"/>Oyêgemere Nyamuzinda n’omurhima gwâwe gwoshi, orhanahîraga okayêgemera obwenge bwâwe wênene.<verse eid="PRO 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 3:6"/>Omu mirimo yâwe yoshi orhahîraga okamuhaba, Wâbona oku ayumanyanya enjira zâwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 3:7"/>Orhacîkebagwa mpu okola oli murhimanya: okazirhînya Nyakasane onayâke amabî;<verse eid="PRO 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 3:8"/>Okwôla kwaciza omubiri gwâwe, kunabombêze orhuvuha rhwâwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 3:9"/>Okazikenga Nyakasane omu kumurhûla ebi ogwêrhe, haguma n’ebirhanzi-rhanzi by’omu misî yâwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omwâka muhyâhya, omwâna wa burhanzi, enterekwa y’omuntu, lyàli irhegeko okurhûla Nyakasane omwâka muhyâhya omu kushénga omushigo n’okuvuga omûnkwa (sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 18:12-13">Mib 18, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:28-29">Lush 14, 28-29</ref></char>).</char></note>;<verse eid="PRO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 3:10"/>Ago mango enguli zâwe zanayunjula ngano, n’emikenzi yâwe yanayunjulirana irivayi lihyâhya.<verse eid="PRO 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 3:11"/>Mwâna wâni, orhakengulaga obuhane bwa Nyakasane, Orhanayumvagya kubî okakalihirwa<verse eid="PRO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 3:12"/>Bulya Nyakasane kwo akalihira oyu asîma, nka kula omulume akalihira omugala arhonya. Iragi ly’omurhimanya<verse eid="PRO 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 3:13"/>Ali muntu muny’iragi obona âhika oku burhimanya, omuntu obona ahika oku makengu.<verse eid="PRO 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 3:14"/>Bulya aha omuntu ankabona amagerha, ankabona oburhimanya: Obugwêrhe ye yunguka kulusha ogwêrhe amasholo.<verse eid="PRO 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 3:15"/>Bulushire amagerha citwìro; mw’ebi omuntu acîfinja byoshi ntà kantu kabuhisirekwo.<verse eid="PRO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 3:16"/>Bufumbasire omu kulyo, omwandu gw’ensiku, n’omu kulembe obuhirhi bw’irenge!<verse eid="PRO 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 3:17"/>Enjira bugera mwo ziri njira za masîma, n’emikâba bugeza mw’omuntu, ebwa murhûla<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omurhûla cirhali cidêkêrera kwônene c’okubà ntà mbaka zihali ci kuli kuhashirya bwinjà ehyâwe buzira bihamba bici, go mango baderha eno mwîrhu, mpu: arhaganya buligo arhanabulânga (sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 8:18">Mig 8, 18</ref></char>) n’omu Ndagâno Mpyâhya, omurhûla bubà. bwinjà buli endalâla omu murhima gw’omuntu, ngalo ya Mûka Mwimâna.</char></note> ehêka.<verse eid="PRO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 3:18"/>Bubà murhi gwa kalamo oku muntu obufumbasire; n’obugwêrhe anashube muntu obêrîrwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 3:19"/>Nyakasane bushinganyanya àlemagamwo igulu, àyimânika amalunga n’obukengêre.<verse eid="PRO 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 3:20"/>Emisima bumanye bwâge bwayihûmbaga, n’olumè bitù bikazilurhoza.<verse eid="PRO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 3:21"/>Mwâna wâni, ebi byombi obisêzekwo amasù: obîke ihano, olange n’obwîrhonzi;<verse eid="PRO 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 3:22"/>Byo byabâ buzîne bw’omurhima gwâwe, bunabè bulimbi bw’igosi lyâwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 3:23"/>Ago mango wanashûrha enjira yâwe buzira bwôba n’okugulu kwâwe kurhasârhalè.<verse eid="PRO 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 3:24"/>Aha kugwîshira orhâyumve côbà, n’amango okola ogwîshîre, irô lyâwe lyâbà linunu.<verse eid="PRO 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 3:25"/>Orhàyôbohe cikango, orhâyôbohè kurherwa n’abaminya.<verse eid="PRO 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 3:26"/>Bulya Nyakasane abâ burhwâli bwâwe, acinga okugulu kwâwe oku mirhego.<verse eid="PRO 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 3:27"/>Orhalahiraga ecijiro cinjà oku muntu ocikwânîne, nk’ogwêrhe obuhashe bw’okucîjira.<verse eid="PRO 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 3:28"/>Orhahîraga okabwîra omulungu, mpu: «genda, ogere lundi lusiku», erhi, mpu: «irhondo nâkuhâ», n’obwo kalya kântu kali omu nfune zâwe.<verse eid="PRO 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 3:29"/>Orhahîraga okasîngira omulungu obulyâlya, n’obwo yêhe acîkwîkubagîre.<verse eid="PRO 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 3:30"/>Orhagwârhiraga omuntu oku lûnu wamulôngôza, na ntà kubî akujirîre,<verse eid="PRO 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 3:31"/>Orhayâgalagwa n’omuntu w’embaka, orhanahîraga okacîshoga enjira zâge.<verse eid="PRO 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 3:32"/>Bulyâla abahalanjisi Nyakasane arhababâkwo, abantu nkana bwo arhonya.<verse eid="PRO 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 3:33"/>Enyumpa y’omumînya ebà ehehêrîrwe na Nyakasane, enyumpa y’abashinganyanya yôhe ebà ngishe.<verse eid="PRO 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 3:34"/>Ayishishekera ba-cinya-masheka, ci abagûnda kurhona bârhona emwâge.<verse eid="PRO 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 3:35"/>Irenge gwo mwanya gw’abarhimanya, ebingolo-ngolo byôhe okukobwa ko kâbo kashambala.<verse eid="PRO 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PRO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Okucîshoga oburhimanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 4:1"/>Bâna bâni, yumvi enyigîrizo za sho, murhege okurhwiri lyo mumanya obwenge.<verse eid="PRO 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 4:2"/>bulya nyigîrizo nyinjà namuhà: murharhibaga akanwa kâni.<verse eid="PRO 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 4:3"/>Nali muburhe: mugala wa lârhâ! nali mwinjà na murhonyi omu masù ga nyâmâ.<verse eid="PRO 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 4:4"/>Nabwîne Lârha akazimbwîra, erhi: Omurhima gwâwe gusêze ebinwa byâni, osêze amarhegeko gâni wâlama.<verse eid="PRO 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 4:5"/>Oyanke oburhimanya, oyanke obwenge, orhayîbagiraga, orhacîhambûlaga oku mahano gâni.<verse eid="PRO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 4:6"/>Orhabusigaga nyuma, bwâkulanga, oburhonye bwakubîka.<verse eid="PRO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 4:7"/>Omurhondêro gw’oburhimanya; kuyanka oburhimanya kuguza ebi ogwêrhe byoshi obone amakengu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nka kulîra omurhondêro gw’okuyôga kuli kujà omu mîshi ly’omuntu amanyiyôga, n’okwo kujà omu mîshi kuligi kurhenga eburhambi bwâgo.</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 4:8"/>Obushamâmbire, bwakuhira enyanya, bwâshuba irenge lyâwe okubuhôbera,<verse eid="PRO 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 4:9"/>Oku irhwe lwâwe bwâdêkerezakwo ecimanè cikukwânîne bwâkuhêreza ecimanè c’irenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Binwa îshe àkazagimubwîriza.</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîlanga oku bantu babî</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 4:10"/>Yumva mwâna wâni, yumva ebinwa nâkubwîra; wâbona oku emyâka y’akalamo kâwe yâluga<verse eid="PRO 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 4:11"/>Njira ya burhimanya nkuyeresire, omu njira nnungêdu nkugezize.<verse eid="PRO 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 4:12"/>Omu kulambagira amagulu gâwe ntâco câgahanza, ciru wankakûla omulindi, orhâsarhalè.<verse eid="PRO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 4:13"/>Ogwârhe enyigîrizo orhazirhibaga, ozilange, ko kalamo kâwe.<verse eid="PRO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 4:14"/>Orhageraga omu njira z’abaminya, orhayishaga omu njira z’abantu babî.<verse eid="PRO 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 4:15"/>Okaziziyâka orhazigeragamwo, onagere kuli orhaluke.<verse eid="PRO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 4:16"/>Bulya barhajà irô barhanajikola amaligo, barhabona irô nka barhacijira enkumba;<verse eid="PRO 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 4:17"/>na bulya mugati gwa bumînya balya, n’irivayi banywa lya buhagwè.<verse eid="PRO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 4:18"/>Enjira y’abashinganyanya kw’eri nka bucè bwa lubûngu-bûngu, bwo buyisha bwakula kalinde kabà kasirahinga.<verse eid="PRO 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 4:19"/>Enjira y’abaminya kwo eyôrha nka mwizimya, Abarhamanya bici bibasârhazize.<verse eid="PRO 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîrhega-rhega</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 4:20"/>Mwâna wâni yùmva bwinjà ebinwa byâni, emyanzi nâkubwîra oyirhege okurhwiri.<verse eid="PRO 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 4:21"/>Erhafulumukaga isù lyâwe, oyibikire oku nyômvu y’omurhima.<verse eid="PRO 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 4:22"/>Kulya kubà kali kalamo oku muntu wamâyihikakwo, ganali magala oku mubiri gwoshi.<verse eid="PRO 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 4:23"/>Olange omurhima gwâwe, kulusha ebindi byoshi, gwo gubà nshôko y’obuzîne.<verse eid="PRO 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 4:24"/>Akanwa kaderha ehigalu-galu okacîke karhakulirânaga, n’omunwa gubêsha, gurhakugeragaho.<verse eid="PRO 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 4:25"/>Amasù gâwe gakazilola embere, n’obusù bwâwe bukaziyêrekera embere zâwe.<verse eid="PRO 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 4:26"/>Okaziyumanyanya emikâba wagera-mwo, n’enjira zâwe zoshi zikazibà zikomîre.<verse eid="PRO 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 4:27"/>Orhadungiraga ekumosho erhi ekulyo, okugulu kwaze okuyâse obubî.<verse eid="PRO 4:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PRO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Omanye omukazi mugenzi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 5:1"/>Mwâna wâni, yumvîrhiza oburhimanya bwâni, rhega ihano lyâni okurhwiri.<verse eid="PRO 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 5:2"/>Ly’omanyilanga enkengêro zâwe, lyo n’akanwa kâwe kamanyibîka emyanzi, omukazi w’ecishungu orhahîra okamukonolera amasù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vulgata (Bibliya ya cilatini) yo rhuyankire-kwo okuhindula eci cinwa ntya.</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 5:3"/>bulyâla akanwa k’omugenzi, bûci bwa mukè kâgegena, n’ebinwa byâge byo biyêngûla kulusha amavurha.<verse eid="PRO 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 5:4"/>Ci kwône binazînde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omwenda nka gwaciribwa erhi guli mununu, nebyâha kwo na kuguma. 5, 11: Omu kuderha: obone wamâhwêrwa n’omubiri gw’eminyafu. </char></note> erhi kwo byalula nka mutuzo, kwo binayôjiha nka ngôrho ya môji abirhi.<verse eid="PRO 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 5:5"/>Amagulu gâge yo garhandalikira ebwa lufù, n’igenda lyâge yo lihêka ekuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 5:6"/>Lirhayerekera omu njira y’akalamo, ci libà igênda lyadûnga-dûnga burhashîbirira bici.<verse eid="PRO 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 5:7"/>Yumvagya nkubwîre, mwâna wâni, orhazigaga hajira ebyakuyibagiza ebinwa by’oku kanwa kâni:<verse eid="PRO 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 5:8"/>enjira yâwe erhâgeraga hôfi naye, orhanahìraga okalirâna olumvi lw’enyumpa yâge.<verse eid="PRO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 5:9"/>Ehyâwe hyankanatweza ab’embuga, n’ehy’omu misî yâwe hirîbwe nabâgera;<verse eid="PRO 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 5:10"/>wakazînda erhi okola wayâma, obone bamâkulya amagala n’akabale,<verse eid="PRO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 5:11"/>Wakazinda erhi okola wayâma, obona bamâkulya amagala n’akabale,<verse eid="PRO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 5:12"/>onayâkûze, erhi: «oku nabwîne nagayaguza amahano, n’oku nabwîne omurhima gwâni gwarhenguha obuhanûzi»;<verse eid="PRO 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 5:13"/>erhi ntayumvagya izù lyàbakazagimbwiriza, n’abàkazaginyigîriza ntabayumvirhizagya;<verse eid="PRO 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 5:14"/>mpu hindi hitya ntahanyagalira aha ngombe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu ngombe mwo bahanira enkola maligo (sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24, 16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">Lush 17, 7</ref>; <ref loc="SIR 1:30">Burh 1, 30</ref></char>).</char></note>, omu ndêko y’abashamuka.<verse eid="PRO 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 5:15"/>Kazi onywe amîshi g’omu mugomero gwâwe, mîshi gàrhenga omu iriba lyâwe.<verse eid="PRO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 5:16"/>Amîshi g’amaliba gâwe garhakazâgihululira embuga, n’enyîshi zâwe zirhajaga omu ngo z’emubânda.<verse eid="PRO 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 5:17"/>Ziyôrhe ziri zâwe wêne, ci murhazishângiraga n’abâgera!<verse eid="PRO 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 5:18"/>Enshôko yâwe ekayâgirwa! Osîme mukâwe w’eburhò.<verse eid="PRO 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 5:19"/>Kashafu kazigirwa, mutwîrà gwa kashafu, ayôrhe akuganîza; n’ibêre lyâge likazikuhiramwo orukara, onakaziyôrha orhonya okurhonya akurhonya.<verse eid="PRO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 5:20"/>Mwâna wâni cankarhuma warhebwa n’omukazi mugenzi, cankarhuma wâziga wayêgemera ecifuba c’omugera wâgera?<verse eid="PRO 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 5:21"/>Omanye oku amasù ga Nyakasane kubona gabona omuntu, kulolêreza galolêreza igênda lyâge.<verse eid="PRO 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 5:22"/>Omumînya anagwarhwe omu mirhego y’amabî gâge, anashwêkerwe n’omu migozi y’ecâha câge yênene.<verse eid="PRO 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 5:23"/>Kufà anafà bulya arhabwîrwa, n’isirhe lyâge kubabula lyânamubabule.<verse eid="PRO 5:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PRO 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Okucîhâna cikinja</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 6:1"/>Mwâna wâni, omunyâge ecirondo bulyâla acîhânyire ncungura oku w’ihanga, na kuli oyu orhamanyiri omuhûnekwoye ecikinja.<verse eid="PRO 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 6:2"/>erhi ankabà wacîshwêsire n’ebinwa waderhaga wêne, erhi ankabà wagwâsirwe omu binwa byâwe wênene;<verse eid="PRO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 6:3"/>alaga oku wajira mwâna wâni: ocirikûze, obwôla wacîhanyire omu nfune z’omulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinza Vulgata: nk’omuntu analire omwenda gwa bene, anagujuhe duba, ciru bwankayira.</char></note>: onakanye otule omulungu wâwe,<verse eid="PRO 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 6:4"/>amasù gâwe orhagahaga irò, n’engohe zâwe orhazirhamûlaga.<verse eid="PRO 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 6:5"/>Ocîrikûze nka kashafu omu murhego, nka kulya akanyunyi kafulumuka omu lusî.<verse eid="PRO 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwôlo n’ebinyegere</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 6:6"/>Genda olole ebinyegere oyu mwôlo! Sinza engeso zâbyo, oyigirekwo oburhimanya:<verse eid="PRO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 6:7"/>hirhajira murhambo, birhajira mulezi, birhajira obiyimangire omu mukolo.<verse eid="PRO 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 6:8"/>Cânda birheganya ebiryo byabyo, n’amango g’okusârûla lyo bihaka olwîko lwâbyo.<verse eid="PRO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 6:9"/>Oyu mwôlo-mwôlo wêki, ogwîshîre kuhika mangaci? Mangaci warhengamwo eri irô lyâwe?<verse eid="PRO 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 6:10"/>Mpu: «warhangihûnga hitya», mpu: «warhangibâ nka wahira olugobe oku lundi », mpu: «warhangibâ nka waheba okuboko oku kwâbo ocîhêngeke!»<verse eid="PRO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 6:11"/>Oku obuligo bwahanda aha mwâwe nka mubalama, n’ecizômbo cikutulisirekwo amatumu!<verse eid="PRO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Endyâlya erhamera ngohe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 6:12"/>Endyâlya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endyâlya erhamera ngohe: «endyâlya erhagania goshhi erhacîkubagirwa bulya arhali muntu nkana».</char></note>, muntu wa busha! egenda ehengwîre akanwa wâni!<verse eid="PRO 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 6:13"/>eje yagohya gohya erhânayimusa kugulu, enabulija yashâsa eminwe!<verse eid="PRO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 6:14"/>Murhima mugalu-galu ogurhahiga agarhali maligo, gurhanahwa gurhâzûsa mmanja.<verse eid="PRO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 6:15"/>Kuhera gwânâhere buzira kulâlira, gurhibuke gurhakanabukwa.<verse eid="PRO 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebikabulirwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 6:16"/>Ebi Nyakasane ashomba biri ndarhu, n’ebi omurhima gwâge gurhabonakwo biri nda:<verse eid="PRO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 6:17"/>Amasù gw’omuntu ogayana, olulimi lw’omunywesi enfune zibulaga omukô gw’omuntu mwêru-kwêru;<verse eid="PRO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 6:18"/>Omurhima guhizire emihigo mibî, amagulu gakanyize mpu gajikola amaligo:<verse eid="PRO 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 6:19"/>Omuhamîrizi wahamîriza obunywesi, na cishombanya washombanya abaguma.<verse eid="PRO 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano gw’omuzîre mushamuka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 6:20"/>Mwâna wâni, kazi olange amahano ga sho, orhanarhibaga amahano ga nyoko.<verse eid="PRO 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 6:21"/>Okaziyôrha ogasêgìze oku murhima, okazigayambalira omu igosi.<verse eid="PRO 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 6:22"/>Gakazikuhabûla omu njira zâwe, gakuyimangire amango oli irô, gakuganîze amango watulûka.<verse eid="PRO 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 6:23"/>Bulyâla irhegeko kabà kamole, n’enyigîrizo bubà bumoleke; okukalihirwa n’okuyigîrizibwa eri njira ya kalamo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okayumva mpu mwene lebè ayengeha, erhi ajira ecibwîriza. </char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 6:24"/>Kuderha mpu bakulange oku mukazi w’ecirala, n’oku lubohôlolo lw’omukazi mugenzi.<verse eid="PRO 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 6:25"/>Omurhima gwâwe gurhâgalagwa n’iranga lyâge, omanye wankarhebwa n’okukoma-komya kw’engohe zâge.<verse eid="PRO 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 6:26"/>Bulyâla omukazi w’ecishungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nka kula rhunaderha omu mashi, mpu: omukazi mugenzi ye «tulye twende» gwârhi abazihi b’akashâra, kukenya akenya ocîrhegaye. Mukà-bene acirigi mudârhi kulusha. </char></note> hihimbi hya mugati alonza, mukà bene yêhe kunyaga anyaga omuntu akalamo, n’obwo kali ka citwîro cidârhi.<verse eid="PRO 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 6:27"/>K’omuntu ankayâkiza (kufulika) omuliro oku nda, n’emishangi ayâmbirhe ebule bwabôyôka?<verse eid="PRO 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 6:28"/>K’omuntu ankalabarha oku màsèsè anabule bwahîra omu lushando?<verse eid="PRO 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 6:29"/>Kwo abâ ntyo omuntu oyiguza mukà owâbo, owamâhumakwo mukà bene arhayêra.<verse eid="PRO 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 6:30"/>Omuntu ozimbira enda nk’ashalisire, arhatumuzibwa.<verse eid="PRO 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 6:31"/>Ci kwône akagwârhwa, anagalule kali nda kalushire, ciru ahâne n’ebiri omu mwâge byoshi.<verse eid="PRO 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 6:32"/>Omuntu wâhusha yêhe eri mbula-murhima, ôkola ebiri ntyo erhi mûhera.<verse eid="PRO 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 6:33"/>Gucîlerhere empîmbo n’amasheka, n’ishêmbo gucîhira-kwo ntyo, lirharhenga.<verse eid="PRO 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 6:34"/>Bulyâla emitula n’obukali bw’ibà wa nyamukazi, birhamuzigira ababalira ahâli h’okocîhôla.<verse eid="PRO 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 6:35"/>Arhâyêmêre ciru empongano nguma, arhâyêmêre bici ciru bakaluza empyûlo.<verse eid="PRO 6:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PRO 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Omukazi mugenzi arhankacîshingikwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 7:1"/>Mwâna wâni olange bwinjà ebinwa nkubwîzire obîkirire amarhegeko nkuhîre.<verse eid="PRO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 7:2"/>Olange amarhegeko gâni gakuciza, amahano gâni gabè nka mbonyi y’amasù gâwe.<verse eid="PRO 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 7:3"/>Amahano ogashwêkere oku minwe yâwe, ogayandike oku lwâsi lw’omurhima gwâwe.<verse eid="PRO 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 7:4"/>Obwîre oburhimanya erhi: we mwâli wîrhu n’obwenge obubwîre, erhi: we mwîra wâni<verse eid="PRO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 7:5"/>Lyo bakucînga oku mukazi mugenzi, oku mukazi w’ebinwa by’olubohôlolo.<verse eid="PRO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 7:6"/>Aha idirisha ly’enyumpa yâge ayêgemera, akazilola omu ngo y’emuhanda.<verse eid="PRO 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 7:7"/>mpu ahâli ankabona omu bâna bahunyi omurhabana (mwinjà) muhwinja.<verse eid="PRO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 7:8"/>Lêro muguma anacigera omu muhanda, aha irhwêrhwè lyâgo, hôfi n’enjira y’enyumpa ya nyamukazi<verse eid="PRO 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 7:9"/>bwamânajinga omwizimya gûkola guli, obudufu bwacîbulwîre n’ehizimya erhi ho ndi aho.<verse eid="PRO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 7:10"/>Nyamukazi kwo kujà emunda nyamwâna ali, nyamukazi ayambîrhâge nka mbaraga, anacibwikîre obusù n’omushângi.<verse eid="PRO 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 7:11"/>Oku arhahusa buderha, kwo arhânadêkerera haguma; amagulo gâge garhabêra omu nyumpa.<verse eid="PRO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 7:12"/>Nk’arhali omu mihanda erhi mwo ali omu ngo z’emuhânda, erhi arhegîre ah’irhwêrhwè ly’omuhanda.<verse eid="PRO 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 7:13"/>Nyamukazi kwo kugwârha olya mwâna, amuhôbera, àmubwîra buzira nshonyi:<verse eid="PRO 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 7:14"/>Erhi «nali wa kurherekêra enterekêro ya nyabuholwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enterekêro ya nyabuholwe, yo nterekêro y’omurhûla (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 7:15-16">Lev 7, 15-16</ref></char>). Enyama y’eyo nterekêro egwêrhe omwânya gwa Nyamuzinda, ogw’abadâhwa, n’eyindi nyama byânalirwa ebijumbu ko kalêmbu k’owahanaga enterekêro. Hali ezindi nyama zalikwânîne zilâle na buca zibè lyo zihânwa nterekêro kandi erhi lundi lusiku (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 7:15-17">Lev 7, 15-17</ref></char>).</char></note>, ene lyo nanashalaga ecihango.<verse eid="PRO 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 7:15"/>Bwo bulà nyishire emunda oli, nti nyishikulônza namânakushingâna!<verse eid="PRO 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 7:16"/>Ecibwârhalo câni nacibûmbire bibwîkwa, nalambûlirakwo amalikâni g’e Mîsiri<verse eid="PRO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 7:17"/>Encingo yâni nayishahulîzekwo amavurha g’akisûnunu, amavurha ga alowesi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mîra, alowêsi na cinamomi: ebà mirhi y’e Buharahu enakazirhengakwo amalâshi.</char></note> na cinamomu.<verse eid="PRO 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 7:18"/>Yishaga, amasîma rhugalaluke bulinde buca, oleke rhuyumve ebinuna.<verse eid="PRO 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 7:19"/>Omulume nn’emwâni arhali aha kâ; àgenzire, àbalamire ekulî.<verse eid="PRO 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 7:20"/>Ahêsire enshoho yâge y’amagerha, okugaluka aha mwâge erhi omwêzi gukola mukulu!»<verse eid="PRO 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 7:21"/>Nyamukazi àmuhima n’orhwanzi rhunji-rhunji, amushîsha-shîsha n’obulimîrhizi, àmuhêka.<verse eid="PRO 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 7:22"/>Nyamwâna omu buhunyi bwâge àmukulikira, kula enkâfu enakulikira odwîrhe akêre; kula akashafu kagwârhwa omu murhego,<verse eid="PRO 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 7:23"/>empiru erinde ekarhula obudiku. Kula akanyunyi kanahenekera obulembo, karhanamanyiri oku kufà kâjifà!<verse eid="PRO 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 7:24"/>Yumvagya nkubwîre mwâna wâni, yumvîrhiza ebinwa nâkubwîra:<verse eid="PRO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 7:25"/>Omanye omurhima gwâwe gwankanahabukira emunda ow’ecishungu ali. Orhanahabukiraga omu njira zâge,<verse eid="PRO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 7:26"/>bulyâla enkumba àjizire zirhali nyi, ciru nabali bazibu-zibu abalambika.<verse eid="PRO 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 7:27"/>Enyumpa yâge njira y’ekuzimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mw’eci cigabi ca kali-munâni n’eca kali-mwenda mwo muli omurhima gw’enyigîrizo ziyêrekîre oburhimanya omu nyigîrizo z’emigani. -Oburhimanya ciri cigabi cinene ca kalamo omuntu yêshi ankahashicîfìnja (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 28">Ayu 28</ref>; <ref loc="BAR 3:9-4:4">Bar 3, 9—4, 4</ref></char>) -Ako kantu kinjà kanaderhwe nka kulya omuntu wajà wahamagala bugenda-jira (sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 1:20-33">Mig 1, 20-33</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:16-19">3, 16-19</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8-9">8—9</ref></char>). Anajà aganîra amâburhwa gâge n’oku àli aha bàlemaga igulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 8:22-36">8, 22-36</ref></char>).</char></note>, mwandagalo gujà omu lugò lw’abafîre.<verse eid="PRO 7:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PRO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yûmva kurhi Burhimanya ayâkûza</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 8:1"/>K’arhali kuyâkûza okwo oburhimanya budwîrhe bwayâkûza? K’arhali kuhamagala okwo obumva bwahamagala<verse eid="PRO 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 8:2"/>Oku busongerwe bw’entondo, omu mulimbwa, aha mashanganjira ho butwîrîre ecirâlo;<verse eid="PRO 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 8:3"/>aha mihango y’olugo, aha bagerera bajà omu lugo ho bayâkûlîze.<verse eid="PRO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 8:4"/>Mpu: «mwe mbwîzire mwe balume, mwe nyâkûzize mwe muburhwa n’abantu ».<verse eid="PRO 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 8:5"/>Mwe bagûnda muyige obulenga, ninyu mwe bahwinja mujâge mwayengeha.<verse eid="PRO 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 8:6"/>Muyumve, bulya mwanzi-nyalyanzè nâderha, na bulya binwa bya bushinganyanya byârhenga omu kanwa kâni<verse eid="PRO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 8:7"/>Binwa by’oku akanwa kâni kâderha, obulyâlya burhambâ ekanwa.<verse eid="PRO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 8:8"/>Ebinwa by’ekanwa kâni byoshi bibà bya bushinganyanya, birhabâmwo burhebanyi birhabâmwo nzonza.<verse eid="PRO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 8:9"/>Byoshi bibà bishingânîne oku muntu oyûmva bibà bishongêze oku muntu ogwêrhe obumanye.<verse eid="PRO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 8:10"/>Murhonye ihano ahâli ha amagerha, Obumanye erhi bwo ahâli h’amasholo.<verse eid="PRO 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 8:11"/>Bulyâla oburhimanya bwo bukulu, aha magerha, ntà kantu wankabugerera kwo. Yûmva oku oburhimanya bwacîvuga<verse eid="PRO 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 8:12"/>Niene Burhimanya, nie Nn’obulenga, nie nâsingaga obulenga, nasînga n’amakengu.<verse eid="PRO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 8:13"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane kwo kushomba obubî; oku nshômba okucîbona kwo nshômba n’okugayana, obwôrhere bubî n’akanwa kanywesi.<verse eid="PRO 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 8:14"/>Nie njira ihano, nie njira okukoza omu binwa nie nn’obukengêre, nie nn’obuhashe.<verse eid="PRO 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 8:15"/>Nie mbwîriza abâmi oburhegesi, n’abagula nie mbabwiriza okujira amarhegeko.<verse eid="PRO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 8:16"/>Nie mbwîriza abarhambo kurhi bârhambula olubaga, n’abazuzi kurhi bâtwa emmanja.<verse eid="PRO 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 8:17"/>Nsîma abânsîma, abannôngereza banambone.<verse eid="PRO 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 8:18"/>Obugale n’irenge emwâni bishûndwa, ebinja-binjà n’obushinganyanya kwo na kwo.<verse eid="PRO 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 8:19"/>Amalehe nyàna, go makulu aha masholo gacîre obushanja bwâni bwo bukulu oku marhale mîshogwa.<verse eid="PRO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 8:20"/>Mwo nyisha omu njira z’obushinganyanya, omu njira z’amarhegeko,<verse eid="PRO 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 8:21"/>nka nalônza ngaze balya bansîma, nka nalônza mbûmbe enshoho zâbo.<verse eid="PRO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Burhimanya bukola byoshi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 8:22"/>Nyakasane àli angwêrhe emurhondêro gw’emikolo yâge, embere ajire emikolo yâge mirhanzi-rhanzi.<verse eid="PRO 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 8:23"/>Kurhenga ensiku n’amango erhi ndi mulume, kurhondêrera emurhondêro, embere igulu lirhangire.<verse eid="PRO 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 8:24"/>Amango enyênga erhàli ecihaba naburhwa, erhi enshôko zahulula zirhacihabà.<verse eid="PRO 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 8:25"/>Embere entondo zigwîkwe naburhwa, erhi n’orhushozi rhurhacishongêra amango rhwahabà.<verse eid="PRO 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 8:26"/>Arhâli acijira igulu n’amashwa, nîsi erhi orhujuma rhurhanzi-rhanzi rhw’akatulo k’igulu?<verse eid="PRO 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 8:27"/>Amango àyimânikaga amalunga erhi ho ndi; amango àtwaga eciriba oku nyanya z’omuhengere,<verse eid="PRO 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 8:28"/>amango àsezagya ebitù by’emalunga, amango àyumanyanyagya enshôko z’enyênga,<verse eid="PRO 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 8:29"/>amango àtwîraga enyanja olubibi, n’amîshi garhatwe olwo lubibi.<verse eid="PRO 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 8:30"/>Ho nali aha burhambi bwâge erhi ndwîrhe nabirhondekeza byoshi, nakazimushasa ngasi lusiku, nakazisharhira ngasi mango omu masù gâge.<verse eid="PRO 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 8:31"/>Nkola n’àrhabira oku igulu, nakazisîma okukômerana n’abâna b’abantu. Oyûmva ye lyà n’entânda<verse eid="PRO 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 8:32"/>Muyumvagye bâna bâni: bali bany’iragi abalanga enjira zâni.<verse eid="PRO 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 8:33"/>Muyumvîrhize enyigîrizo lyo mubà barhimanya, murhazigayaguzagya.<verse eid="PRO 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 8:34"/>Ali muny’iragi omuntu wanyumva, omuntu oyîza ngasi lusiku aha nyumvi zâni.<verse eid="PRO 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 8:35"/>Bulyâla ombwîne erhi abwîne akalamo, kurhona àrhona omu masù ga Nyamubâho;<verse eid="PRO 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PRO 8:36"/>Ci ongayisize erhi iroho lyâge akolîre buligo: ngasi yêshi onshômba erhi lufù arhonyize.<verse eid="PRO 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PRO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Burhimanya abâzire</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 9:1"/>Burhimanya àjire aho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Burhimanya ali nka mukazi wa mbuguma, nna-bâna erhi nna-munene.</char></note> ayûbaka enyumpa yâge, àyigwikira mitûngo nda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mitûngo nda: «ciri cimanyîso ca buhirhi, bugale bw’eyo nyumpa». «Ndà» cibà cimanyîso c’obwimâna emw’Abayahudi.</char></note>;<verse eid="PRO 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 9:2"/>Abâga ebimasha byâge, àkanda irivayi anarheganya ameza gâge.<verse eid="PRO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 9:3"/>Ajire aho àrhuma abambali-kazi, mpu bagendiyâkûza omu irângo oku lugo:<verse eid="PRO 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 9:4"/>Mpu: «ndi orhagwêrhi kwâge? Mpu ayishe emunda ndi» n’omusirhe, kwo Burhimanya amubwîzire:<verse eid="PRO 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 9:5"/>erhi: «yisha olye oku mugati gwâni, onywe n’oku irivayi nakandaga».<verse eid="PRO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 9:6"/>Erhi «muleke isirhe mwabona akalamo, mugere omu njira y’okuli»<verse eid="PRO 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyânga oshekera abandi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 9:7"/>Ohakanya omugambanyi anacîshombanye, okalihira enkola-maligo anacîjacizè.<verse eid="PRO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 9:8"/>Orhahakanyagya omugambanyi mwankanashombana, ohakanye omurhimanya akusîma<verse eid="PRO 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 9:9"/>Ohè omurhimanya, abâ murhimanya kulusha; obwîrize omushinganyanya: ayûshûla obumanye bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 9:10"/>Omurhondêro gw’obushinganyanya kubà kurhînya Nyakasane: Obumanye bw’abatagatîfu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obumanye bw’abatagatîfu: aha, Vulgata* rhukulikire; Ebibliya y’e Yeruzalemu kw’edesire mpu «obumanye bw’omutagatîfu».</char></note> bwône bwenge.<verse eid="PRO 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 9:11"/>Bulyâla niene nâkulugiza ensiku, nie nâkuyushùlira emyâka wâlama.<verse eid="PRO 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 9:12"/>Okabâ murhimanya obunguke buli bwâwe, okabâ mugambanyi wêne kwânababaza.<verse eid="PRO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamusirhye w’omukazi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 9:13"/>Nyamusirhye w’omukazi arhadekerera, ali muhwinja arhanayishi bici.<verse eid="PRO 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 9:14"/>Atamîre aha lusò lw’omu mwâge, oku ntebe omu irango ly’olugo,<verse eid="PRO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 9:15"/>Mpu ahamagale àbâgera, àbali omu njira yâbo.<verse eid="PRO 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 9:16"/>Mpu: «ndi ociri cirhabà?», «agere eno munda» n’omulume musirhe ye nyâmà wâni abwîzire,<verse eid="PRO 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 9:17"/>Erhi: «amîshi mazimbano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu bihugo Israheli-Palestina na Israheli, «amîshi» garhali ga cilugè ogahisirekwo kuhika anabîka bwinjinjà, ntyo ciru omushâmbo anayishigazimba nka nnago arhagabisiri bwinjà.</char></note> go ganuna!» n’omugati gw’ebirhangâzo gurhahimwa manyunyà.<verse eid="PRO 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 9:18"/>Na kuziga nyamulume arhishi oku aho hali empehema, n’oku abalâlike ba nyamusirhye w’omukazi, omu rhubanda rhw’ekuzimu bali.<verse eid="PRO 9:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PRO 10"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. ecitabu c’emigani yayandikagwa na Salomoni</para>
  <para style="s1">Oburhimanya n’obuhwinja</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 10:1"/>Migani ya Salomoni. Omwâna murhimanya ye mushagalusa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ah’oburhimanya buli kuyinjiha hayinjiha, kusîmîsa hanasîmîsa.</char></note> w’îshe. Omwâna musirhe burhè anajira nnina.<verse eid="PRO 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 10:2"/>Eby’obushambo birhaciza, obushinganyanya bôhe bunakûle omuntu omu lufù.<verse eid="PRO 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 10:3"/>Nyakasane arhaziga omushinganyanya afà n’ishali, ye na zigulula amagene g’enyankola-maligo.<verse eid="PRO 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 10:4"/>Njingo zihozire, buligo afulusa, njingo zikanyire bugale afulusa.<verse eid="PRO 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 10:5"/>Ohaka cânda ye mwenge, oj’irô amango basârûla ye bya-nshonyi.<verse eid="PRO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 10:6"/>Omugisho gwa Nyakasane oku irhwe ly’omushinganyanya kufà murhò kurhuma enkola-maligo yâgokôla.<verse eid="PRO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 10:7"/>Izîno ly’omushinganyanya irenge lijà, izîno ly’enkola-maligo cibolwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 10:8"/>Mwenge oyêmêra bamurhegeke, omuhwinja w’akalimi kuhera anahera.<verse eid="PRO 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 10:9"/>Oshûrha enjira yâge kwône, âgenda arhîmûsirwe, ojà ayahuka arhabula cishobesire.<verse eid="PRO 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 10:10"/>Olola ayûbisire amasù, analîse owundi n’amagala, ci okalihira omuntu anamulola omu masù, anamushubize omurhima omu nda.<verse eid="PRO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 10:11"/>Akanwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu kanwa murhengwa: munarhenge ebinwa byaciza, murhenge nakakayîrha erhi kalogorhere lebè, kagayise omuntu.</char></note> kw’omushinganyanya nshôko ya buzîne, akanwa k’enkola-maligo kôhe, ntambala kabà kabwikire.<verse eid="PRO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 10:12"/>Enshombo kadali ezûsa, n’obuzigire bunabwîkire obubî bwoshi.<verse eid="PRO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 10:13"/>Akanwa kw’omugula, burhimanya bubà-mwo, oku mugongo gw’endyâlya mibambu ekubâ,<verse eid="PRO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 10:14"/>Barhimanya babîka Obumanye, akanwa kw’omusirhe kôhe ye côkeza, Oburhimanya n’obugale<verse eid="PRO 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 10:15"/>Obugale bw’omuhirhi, lwo lwâkiro lwâge, obubî bw’omuganda, bunali bulya bukenyi bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 10:16"/>Ikola ly’entagengwa kuciza liciza, ci obunguke bw’enkola-maligo kuheza buheza.<verse eid="PRO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 10:17"/>Njira ya kalamo, okubîka ihano wahâbagwa, ntadûndwa yêhe kuhabuka anahabuka. Okuderha kubî n’okuderha kwinjà<verse eid="PRO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 10:18"/>Akanwa kashingânîne kanafunge entambala, ôderha akanwa kabî erhi muhwinja.<verse eid="PRO 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 10:19"/>Oderha bwenêne arhabula ah’akubîze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omwâna oderha bwenêne anaderhe ah’îshe alìre omwênda (mugani gwa Bashi).</char></note>, ôlanga akanwa kâge erhi mwîrhonzi.<verse eid="PRO 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 10:20"/>Olulimi lw’entagengwa gabà marhale gacîre, omurhima gw’enkola-maligo gurhagwêrhi citwîro cinganaci!<verse eid="PRO 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 10:21"/>Akanwa k’entagengwa kanashalûle rubannda, ci abakenyi omu bukenyi banafira. Entagengwa n’omumînya<verse eid="PRO 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 10:22"/>Mugisho gwa Nyakasane gugaza omuntu, emisî yône-yône erhajira cici.<verse eid="PRO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 10:23"/>Omusirhe asîma abulage omukò, omuntu wabona yêhe akûnda âgendekere oburhimanya.<verse eid="PRO 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 10:24"/>Omumînya ebi arhînya byo anabona, omushinganyanya naye oku acîfinjire kwo anabona.<verse eid="PRO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 10:25"/>Erhi entambala ehwa erhi na ntà mumînya ocihali, ci omushinganyanya erhi ye kola oyîmanzire kulya kw’ensiku n’amango.<verse eid="PRO 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 10:26"/>Kula enkalishi eyôrha omu mîno, n’omugî omu masù kwo n’omwôlo ayôrha omu masù gw’owamurhumaga<verse eid="PRO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 10:27"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane kunayûshûlire omuntu ensiku emyâka y’omumînya yôhe kunyihya bayinyihya.<verse eid="PRO 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 10:28"/>Okulinda kw’abarhimanya gubâ mwishingo, ebi abaminya bacîkubagira kufânanda binafànanda.<verse eid="PRO 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 10:29"/>Nyakasane abâ Côbohwa c’enkola-maligo, abâ Lwâkiro lw’entagengwa<verse eid="PRO 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 10:30"/>Ntà mango omushinganyanya ankadûndagana, enkola-maligo zôhe zirhâyûbake omu cihugo.<verse eid="PRO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 10:31"/>Akanwa k’omushinganyanya burhimanya karhengamwo; olulimi lubî kushugulwa lwâshugulwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 10:32"/>Akanwa k’omushinganyanya binjà karhengamwo; n’akanwa k’enkola-maligo, maligo kanarhengamwo.<verse eid="PRO 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PRO 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Obushinganyanya kwâgo n’obulyâlya kwâgo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 11:1"/>Kuli Nyakasane, omunzâni gusherîre binali bikabulirwa, ci kwône omunzâni guyumanîne gwo gurhona emunda ali.<verse eid="PRO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 11:2"/>Aha akagayo kajire erhi cihemu cinahajire, aha obwîrhôhye bwajire erhi burhimanya bunahajire.<verse eid="PRO 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 11:3"/>Abashinganyanya murhima gwa budahemuka gubalangûla enjira: enkola maligo bulyâlya bwâzo bunazihabula.<verse eid="PRO 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 11:4"/>Olusiku lw’omutula, obugale burhâjire bici, Obushinganyanya bôhe bunakûle omuntu omu lufù.<verse eid="PRO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 11:5"/>Obushinganyanya bw’omuntu nkana bunamukâbûlire enjira, oku omumînya ashâya omu bumînya bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 11:6"/>Entagengwa bushinganyanya bwâzo buziciza, enkonola-masù mwo zinagwa omu mirhego yazo.<verse eid="PRO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 11:7"/>Omumînya erhi afà, n’obulangâlire bwâge bunahirigirhe, okulînda kw’ababî kufânanda kufananda.<verse eid="PRO 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 11:8"/>Omushinganyanya anafume entanya. n’enkola-maligo ebè yo ezigwamwo.<verse eid="PRO 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 11:9"/>Akalimi k’endyâlya kanagayîse abalungu, n’obumanye bw’abashinganyanya bubalikûze!<verse eid="PRO 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 11:10"/>Abashinganyanya bakabêrwa, olugo lunasîme, enkola-maligo ekabà buligo, banacishînge.<verse eid="PRO 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 11:11"/>Mugisho gwa bashinganyanya guzûsa olugo, n’akanwa k’enkola-maligo kalushâbe.<verse eid="PRO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagula bayinjiha ekà</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 11:12"/>Omuntu ogaya owâbo erhi muhwinja, omwenge yêhe anacihulikire.<verse eid="PRO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 11:13"/>Ow’akalimi anabase amahwe, oku omwikubagirwa afulisire omwanzi gwa bene.<verse eid="PRO 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 11:14"/>Aharhali murhambo, abantu kuhona banahona, obwôloloke bunali omu kujira abahanûzi.<verse eid="PRO 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 11:15"/>Kulengana analengana omuntu ocîkubagira ecigolo omuntu ocîlanga oku mirhego arhabà kurhi.<verse eid="PRO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Orhugani-gâni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 11:16"/>Omukazi mwinjà lîba irenge ly’îba, ci omukazi oshomba obushinganyanya anabonêsa omuntu nshonyi.<verse eid="PRO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 11:17"/>Ôbà lukogo minjà acîjirira yênene, omuntu ohâna erhi kucîbikira acîbikìre yêne, ci omuntu ominya erhi yêne ocîmînyize.<verse eid="PRO 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 11:18"/>Enkola-maligo enabone oluhembo lwayirheba, omuntu omîra obushinganyanya yêhe, oluhembo lwâge ho luli.<verse eid="PRO 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 11:19"/>Omuntu mushinganyanya kalamo acîfulukiza, okuhenekera amaligo kubà kucîhêka ebwa lufù.<verse eid="PRO 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 11:20"/>Omu masù ga Nyakasane emirhima mibî bibà bikabulirwa, bo arhonya abw’olugêndo nkana<verse eid="PRO 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 11:21"/>Okuli! Omubî arhâbule buhanwa. obûko bw’abashinganyanya bôhe kucira bwacira.<verse eid="PRO 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 11:22"/>Mulinga gwa masholo oku izûlu ly’engulube: mukazi mwinjà buzira bwenge.<verse eid="PRO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 11:23"/>Omwîfinjo gw’abashinganyanya ebwa kucira gubà guyêrekîre, omulangâliro gw’enkola-maligo gôhe gubà gwa busha.<verse eid="PRO 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 11:24"/>Hali abagaba ebyâbo babuligala, abandi balunde ebirugu oku bindi, banabulikena.<verse eid="PRO 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 11:25"/>Omurhima gujira aminjà gwabêrwa, odômera abandi naye àyishidômerwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 11:26"/>Oyôrhana engano yâge kubehêrerwa ahehêrerwa n’olubaga, ci omuntu oguliza abandi engano kusîmwa asîmwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpara-magara arhabula kuguma abîre</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 11:27"/>Olwîra obwinjà kurhona alonza olwîra obubî abubona.<verse eid="PRO 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 11:28"/>Ocîkubagira obugale abushâyamwo, abashinganyanya kwo bajinîrira nka buhasi.<verse eid="PRO 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 11:29"/>Oleka aha mwâge bashûbuka mpûsi asigalana, omuhwinja âzinda erhi àbarhulira omushinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 11:30"/>Emburho y’obushinganyanya yo emerakwo omurhi gw’akalamo enkola-maligo zàhêkwa n’amango garhajihika.<verse eid="PRO 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 11:31"/>Erhi omushinganyanya ahemberwa hanôla igulu, omumînya n’omunya-byâha bôhe kurhi byâyishibà?<verse eid="PRO 11:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PRO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ehinja erhi na hinjà, ehibî erhi na hibî</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 12:1"/>Osîma bamubwîrize asîma amanye, ci oshomba okukalihirwa erhi muhwinja.<verse eid="PRO 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 12:2"/>Omuntu okola bwinjà, anacîlerhere okurhonyibwa na Nyakasane, ci omuntu ocîkubagira enkengêro zâge yêne, erhi nkola-maligo.<verse eid="PRO 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 12:3"/>Ntà muntu obubî buzibuhya, omushinganyanya yêhe abà kadûndu-ntashugulwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyumpa zifulika binji</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 12:4"/>Omukazi nkana irenge ly’îba, omukazi mûmaguza cibà cibolwe omu rhuvuha.<verse eid="PRO 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 12:5"/>Emihigo y’abashinganyanya ebà ya budahemuka, ci emihigo y’enkola-maligo ebà ya kurhebana.<verse eid="PRO 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 12:6"/>Ebinwa by’enkola-maligo: mirhego ya kuyîrha bantu, ci akanwa k’abashinganyanya kanakazihaza mpu bakanagwa mw’eyo mirhego.<verse eid="PRO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 12:7"/>Enkola-maligo ekaja oku idaho, erhazûka, enyumpa y’abashinganyanya yôhe eyôrha eyimanzire.<verse eid="PRO 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 12:8"/>Omulume adulirwa obwîrhonzi bwâge, ow’omurhima gurhashinganini yêhe kugaywa anagugayirwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 12:9"/>Omuntu ogwêrhe omushizi wâge ye mukulu, ahâli h’omuntu ocikuza yêne agali bulà omugati.<verse eid="PRO 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 12:10"/>Entagengwa ebà egendêrîre ebintu byâyo, omurhima gw’enkola-maligo gôhe gubâ mumînya.<verse eid="PRO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 12:11"/>Ohinga ishwa lyâge anakûlemwo omugati ayigurha, ci okulikira ebilôrho erhi musirhe.<verse eid="PRO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olulimi cibà côji</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 12:12"/>Bigalu-galu enkola-maligo zicîfinja, ci kwône emizî y’abantu bashinganyanya eri omu idaho linjà.<verse eid="PRO 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 12:13"/>Enkola-maligo enagwârhwe omu murhego erhi kalimi kâyo karhuma, omushinganyanya yêhe acîrhenze ahabi.<verse eid="PRO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 12:14"/>Oku mukolo gw’akanwa kâge, omuntu anayigurhe ebinja, n’oku omuntu àkozire kwo anahêmbwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 12:15"/>Omusirhe mpu enjira yâge eshingânîne. omurhimanya yêhe anarhangidôsa ihano.<verse eid="PRO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 12:16"/>Omuhwinja anayêrekane oburhè bwâge ho na halya, omwenge yêhe anabè nk’arhali ye bajizire burhè (bagayisize).<verse eid="PRO 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 12:17"/>Okuderha okunali kubà kuhamîriza obushinganyanya, na càli-ho c’obunywesi, erhi wundi munywesi.<verse eid="PRO 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 12:18"/>Omuntu oderha duba, kwo ayagazanya nka ngôrho, ci olulimi lw’abashinganyanya kufumya lufumya.<verse eid="PRO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 12:19"/>Olulimi luderha oku binali lubà lusêzire ensiku zoshi, ci olulimi lunywesi, ensimiko yalwo ya hisanzi hisungunu hyône.<verse eid="PRO 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 12:20"/>Cigadu cizinda omu murhima gwabagerereza amaligo, oku abajà-nnâma b’omurhûla bôhe bâsigalana obusîme.<verse eid="PRO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 12:21"/>Omushinganyanya ntà buhanya bumurhibukira, enkola-maligo zôhe buhanya zifulusa.<verse eid="PRO 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 12:22"/>Nyakasane arhakwirirwa akanwa kabêsha bo arhonya abaderha okunali.<verse eid="PRO 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 12:23"/>Omuntu mwenge anafulike ebi ayishi, omurhima gw’omuhwinja gwône gwône gufulûla isirhe lyâgo.<verse eid="PRO 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 12:24"/>Kuboko kulenga ye warhegeka, kuboko kuhozire ashige owâbo.<verse eid="PRO 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 12:25"/>Omutula omu murhima gw’omuntu njingo guvuna, akanwa kinjà kwôhe kushagalusa kashagalusa<verse eid="PRO 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 12:26"/>Omuntu ohala amagala erhi mwîra wâge orhumire eri ntagengwa, endyâlya zôhe njira yazo ezihabula.<verse eid="PRO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 12:27"/>Omwôlo arhashushagiza hisîmba, obugale bw’omuntu bunali bukômbedu bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 12:28"/>Omu njira y’obushinganyanya mwo akalamo kabà, enjira y’emihabuka yôhe ebwa lufù ehêka.<verse eid="PRO 12:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PRO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Omwâna oderha bwenêne</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 13:1"/>Omwâna mwenge asîma bamubwîrize, oshekasheka arhûmva amango bamâmukalihira.<verse eid="PRO 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 13:2"/>Oku mukolo gw’akanwa kâge, omuntu analume oku hinjà, ci amagene g’endyâlya ntambala egabuka.<verse eid="PRO 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 13:3"/>Olanga akanwa erhi mûka gwâge alanzire, oderha bwenêne kuhera anahera.<verse eid="PRO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okumanyikolêsa ebirugu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 13:4"/>Omwôlo bw’alingira aha ali, ci birhacîlêrha byône, ba bushiru babiyigurha.<verse eid="PRO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 13:5"/>Entagengwa erhakwirirwa binwa bya bunywesi, camaganwa oku abêsherana kw’anahemulana.<verse eid="PRO 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 13:6"/>Bushinganyanya bubika enjira y’obudahemuka, obwamaganwa kushûbula bushûbula nnabwo.<verse eid="PRO 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 13:7"/>Hali ôbà arhajira cici, abulihimba amagale, hali n’ôbà ali nnabyo abulinaba mukenyi.<verse eid="PRO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 13:8"/>Ecicûngula omuntu, bibà birugu byâge; omukenyi yêhe arhayumva nka ye shimbirwe.<verse eid="PRO 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 13:9"/>Akamole kabashinganyanya kabà kakolire, erhi n’itara ly’abâmaganwa lyâzima. <verse eid="PRO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 13:10"/>Akagayo, nnôngwe katula; aha bakengana ho oburhimanya bushundwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 13:11"/>Obugale buyisha duba kuyonda bujà bwayônda; oburhondêra hitya, bwo bujà bwakula.<verse eid="PRO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 13:12"/>Okulangâlira ehi omuntu arhahikakwo, kulîsibwa n’amagala, murhi gwakalamo okubona ehi omuntu acîfinja.<verse eid="PRO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 13:13"/>Ogaya ihano erhi muhera, okenga irhegeko ye wanacira.<verse eid="PRO 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 13:14"/>Ihano ly’omukulu nshôko ya kalamo, bulyo bwa kubona aha walufù arhegîre. <verse eid="PRO 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 13:15"/>Obwîrhonzi bw’omuntu w’amakengu bunarhume arhona; enjira y’abarhebanyi ebà nzibu.<verse eid="PRO 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 13:16"/>Omuntu wabona yêshi erhi ajà eruhya, erhi amarhangidôsa ihano; omuhwinja yêhe acîbirindike n’isirhe lyâge.<verse eid="PRO 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 13:17"/>Ntumwa mbî erhuma omuntu ajâkwo obuhanya, entumwa nkana mugisho.<verse eid="PRO 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 13:18"/>Buli buhanya zinali nshonyi okurhiba ihano, omuntu okuyêmêra ahanûlwa buli bwâmi.<verse eid="PRO 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluhembo lw’oburhimanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 13:19"/>Okuhikakwo ehi omuntu acîfinjaga, kunashagaluse omurhima. Abasirhe barhakwirirwa okuyâka amabî.<verse eid="PRO 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 13:20"/>Okômera abagula naye anabè mugula, okômera abahwinja anashube wundi <verse eid="PRO 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 13:21"/>Obuhanya bubà bukulikire lumino-mîno omunya-byâha, abashinganyanya bwôhe oluhembo lwâbo guli mugisho: munene.<verse eid="PRO 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 13:22"/>Omugula, binjikulu, asigira akashambala kâge, ebi abahwinja basiga, mushinganyanya obiyîmamwo.<verse eid="PRO 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 13:23"/>Ishwa lyomukenyi likahingwa linashalûle, haligi nâbafà erhi kubula bushinganyanya kurhuma.<verse eid="PRO 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 13:24"/>Obîkiriza ehirhi hyâge, erhi omugala anashômba, omusîma bwenêne amukubûla.<verse eid="PRO 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 13:25"/>Omushinganyanya alya anayigurhe, enda y’enkola-maligo erhahwa kulalikira ishali.<verse eid="PRO 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PRO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Oburhimanya lwago n’obuhwinja lwago</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 14:1"/>Burhimanya yêne ocîyûbakira, omusirhe yêne ocîshâbira.<verse eid="PRO 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 14:2"/>Okulikira enjira nnungêdu akenga Nyakasane, n’oshomba enjira zâge amugayaguza.<verse eid="PRO 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 14:3"/>Omu kanwa k’omusirhe mubà enzônza y’obucîbone, abarhimanya bôhe kanwa kâbo kababîka.<verse eid="PRO 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 14:4"/>Aharhali mpanzi zahinga erhi na ntà ngano, âhali empanzi nzibu-nzibu ho n’omwâka guluga.<verse eid="PRO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 14:5"/>Câliho c’okunali arhabêsha, câliho w’obwîhambi kubêsha abêsha.<verse eid="PRO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 14:6"/>Omugambanyi anacihambe mpu ashìmba oburhimanya, okuyigîrira kw’omurhimanya kurhabâ kuzibu.<verse eid="PRO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 14:7"/>Okaziyâka omusirhe, wakanahaba iderha ly’abalenga.<verse eid="PRO 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 14:8"/>Oku muntu mwenge, okucîlanga-langa buli burhimanya, ci isirhe ly’abahwinja kunali kurhebana kwône.<verse eid="PRO 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hali enjira y’abenge n’ey’abahunyi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 14:9"/>Endyâlya kushekera Nyamuzinda azishekera, entagengwa zôhe kurhonya azirhonya.<verse eid="PRO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 14:10"/>Omurhima guyishi burhè bwâgo, n’orhali nnagwo arhashangîra busîme bwâgwo.<verse eid="PRO 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 14:11"/>Enyumpa y’endyâlya kuhya yânahye, oku ecihando c’entagengwa cayôloloka.<verse eid="PRO 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 14:12"/>Hali enjira eboneka nnungêdu, ebulizinda erhi yahêka ekuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 14:13"/>Amasheka ganayishemwo oburhè, n’obusîme buzinde erhi eri mirenge.<verse eid="PRO 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 14:14"/>Omurhima mugalu-galu gunayumve gusîmire enjira zâgwo, n’omuntu nkana anayumve asîmire omukolo gwâge.<verse eid="PRO 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 14:15"/>Idâga lyo liyêmêra ngasi oku banalibwîzire, omwenge yêhe anakazilola bwinjà ah’âgera.<verse eid="PRO 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 14:16"/>Omurhimanya arhahimwa kurhînya n’okuyâka obubî, omuhwinja yêhe aburhûngane mpu ali ntwâli.<verse eid="PRO 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 14:17"/>Ôbà burhè duba anakole ebigalu-galu, omurhimanya yêhe binji alêmbera.<verse eid="PRO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 14:18"/>Isirhe gwo mwanya gw’idâga, abalenga bôhe, obulenga co cimanè câbo.<verse eid="PRO 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 14:19"/>Enkola-maligo zâcihwere oku idaho, ziharamye entagengwa, n’abaminya basengerere aha lumvi lw’omushinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukenyi n’omugale</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 14:20"/>Omukenyi ciru n’omulungu anamushombe, omugale yêhe abîra bâge babà banji.<verse eid="PRO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 14:21"/>Okushomba omukenyi bulenzi, muny’iragi obêra abakenyi bwonjo.<verse eid="PRO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 14:22"/>K’okukola amaligo kurhali kuhaba? Lukogo na burhonyi oku muntu omalîra ebinja obushiru.<verse eid="PRO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 14:23"/>Ngasi mukolo gujira obunguke, ow’akalimi cizômbo ayunguka.<verse eid="PRO 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 14:24"/>Ecimanè c’abarhimanya: obulenga bwâbo, ishungwè ly’abahwinja: isirhe lyâbo.<verse eid="PRO 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 14:25"/>Câliho orhabêsha anagalukire omûka gw’omuntu, ci enderha-kubirhi, bunywesi enaderha.<verse eid="PRO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 14:26"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane kwanayêgemerwa, kunabè lwâkiro lw’abâna bâge.<verse eid="PRO 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 14:27"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane: nshôko ya buzîne nshôko ya kufumya omuntu emirenge y’olufù.<verse eid="PRO 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 14:28"/>Irenge lya mwâmi kubà na ngabo nyinji; muhona oku muluzi abantu bakamunyihira.<verse eid="PRO 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omurhimanya ye na mwîrhonzi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 14:29"/>Omuntu orhûza, bwîrhonzi acirhegekamwo, ci omukali erhi musirhe.<verse eid="PRO 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 14:30"/>Amagala gw’omuntu erhi omurhima gudêkerîre, ci obwâgalwa cibolwe omu rhuvuha.<verse eid="PRO 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 14:31"/>Okulibuza omuganda kubà kugayisa Owamulemaga; ci okubonera omukenyi obwonjo, kukuza Omulemi wâge.<verse eid="PRO 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 14:32"/>Omumînya bumînya bwâge bunamulembika, omushinganyanya yêhe omu budahemuka mwo ashànga olwâkiro.<verse eid="PRO 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 14:33"/>Omu murhima gw’obwîrhonzi mwo oburhimanya bubêra, ci burhimbwa omu murhima gw’abahunyi.<verse eid="PRO 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 14:34"/>Bushinganyanya burhuma ishanja lyayôloloka, okukola amaligo kwo kubonêsa amashânja nshonyi.<verse eid="PRO 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 14:35"/>Omushizi mwîrhonzi ye rhona ebwâmi, n’okulangâlira kwâge kunamucinge arhagitumula.<verse eid="PRO 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PRO 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Hali akanwa kinjà, hali n’akanwa kabî</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 15:1"/>Okushuza kwinjà kunarhûze oburhè, ci okushuza kubî kunazûse embaka.<verse eid="PRO 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 15:2"/>Akanwa k’abarhimanya bishingânîne kaderha, ci akanwa k’ebingolo-ngolo bya bunganyi kaderha.<verse eid="PRO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 15:3"/>Ngasi hoshi amasù ga Nyakasane gali, gali ebulâbi bw’abinja n’ababî.<verse eid="PRO 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 15:4"/>Olulimi lurhûliriza abandi: murhi gwa kalamo ci akalimi kabî kubabaza kababaza omurhima<verse eid="PRO 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 15:5"/>Muhwinja ogayaguza ihano ly’îshe ci oyêmêra bamuhakanya erhi mwenge.<verse eid="PRO 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 15:6"/>Enyumpa y’omushinganyanya eluza ebinja, ci ebi endyâlya efulusa biluza emmanja.<verse eid="PRO 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 15:7"/>Bumanye akanwa k’omurhimanya kamira, ci omurhima gw’omubwinjà, nanga.<verse eid="PRO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 15:8"/>Kuli Nyakasane enterekêro y’enkola-maligo, bishwêka, ci omusengero gw’entagengwa bwenêne agurhonya.<verse eid="PRO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 15:9"/>Kuli Nyakasane olugendo lubî bikabulirwa, ci okulikira obushinganyanya, ye rhona emund’ali.<verse eid="PRO 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 15:10"/>Omuntu ocîrhenza omu njira ali wa kukalihirwa bwenêne, omuntu orhumva ihano yêhe kufâ anafâ.<verse eid="PRO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 15:11"/>Erhi abâga ekuzimu n’enyenga biri omu masù ga Nyakasane, (lêro) omurhima gw’ababurhwa n’abantu, gohe kurhi?<verse eid="PRO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 15:12"/>Omugambanyi arhakwirirwa bamudûnde, arhanayêrekera ahâli abagula.<verse eid="PRO 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 15:13"/>Omurhima gushagalusire gushesa obusù, murhima ali burhè bikûbi abanda.<verse eid="PRO 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 15:14"/>Omurhima gw’oburhimanya gukûnda ihano, akanwa k’abahwinja kohe isirhe likanunira.<verse eid="PRO 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 15:15"/>Kàlibwîre arhajira lusiku lwinjà, kashagali yêhe ngasi lusiku erhi na lukulu.<verse eid="PRO 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enkômedu nyinjà</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 15:16"/>Ebinyi birikwo okurhînya Nyakasane, byo bikulu aha buhirhi bulikwo entanya.<verse eid="PRO 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 15:17"/>Ennambi y’ebishogo-shogo haguma n’obuzigire, yo nkulu aha mpanzi eshushagire enalikwo enshômbo.<verse eid="PRO 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 15:18"/>Omuntu osîma okukunira anazûse ennongwè, omuntu mwîrhonzi yêhe ayirhûze.<verse eid="PRO 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 15:19"/>Enjira y’omwolo ebà eyunjwîre mishûgi, enjira y’obushinganyanya gubâ mulimbwa mugali?<verse eid="PRO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 15:20"/>Omwâna murhimanya ye mushagalusa w’îshe, muhwinja ogaya nnina.<verse eid="PRO 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 15:21"/>Isirhe, lyo omuhwinja asîma, oku omwenge ashûrha enjira yâge.<verse eid="PRO 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 15:22"/>Aharhali buhabûzi, emihigo kufananda efananda, ci ahâli abahabûzi banji, emihigo kuyunjula eyunjula.<verse eid="PRO 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 15:23"/>Omuntu asîma alîke akanwa kinjà, ci kandi bwenêne kulusha asîma akoze omu kushuza.<verse eid="PRO 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 15:24"/>Enjira y’akalamo enahise omwirhonzi enyanya, emuyâse enjira yâjà ekuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 15:25"/>Nyakasane kushâba ashâbira abagambanyi, ci olubibi lw’omukana kuyumanyanya aluyumanyanya.<verse eid="PRO 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 15:26"/>Nyakasane ashômba emihigo y’obulyâlya ci akanwa kinjà, kalya k’obukenge, kurhonya akarhonya.<verse eid="PRO 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 15:27"/>Osîma eby’obushambo anacîshâbire enyumpa, olahira okuhêmbwa yêhe kucira acira.<verse eid="PRO 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 15:28"/>Omurhima gw’abashinganyanya binjinjà gugerêreza, akanwa k’endyâlya kôhe kaluzagye ebigalu-galu.<verse eid="PRO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 15:29"/>Nyakasane abà kuli n’endyâlya, abashinganyanya bôhe anayumve omusengero gwâbo.<verse eid="PRO 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 15:30"/>Okulolwa bwinjà kushagalula kushagalula omurhima, omwanzi mwinjà gunasêze amavuha haguma.<verse eid="PRO 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 15:31"/>Okurhwiri kuyumvîrhiza owakukalihira, kwanabêra ekarhî kabarhimanya.<verse eid="PRO 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 15:32"/>Owâleka ihano erhi kugaya acîgayire, oyumva owamukalihira anarhôle obwenge.<verse eid="PRO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 15:33"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane, kunayigîrize oburhimanya, obwîrhôhye bubà bushokolîre irenge.<verse eid="PRO 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PRO 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Emihigo y’omurhima yo ebà y’omuntu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 16:1"/>Emihigo y’omurhima yo y’omuntu, n’okushuza kwo kwa Nyakasane.<verse eid="PRO 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 16:2"/>Omu masù gw’omuntu enjira zâge zibà nka zishingânîne, ci kwône Nyakasane yêhe ye hombaganya emirhima.<verse eid="PRO 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 16:3"/>Oyâbuze Nyakasane emikolo yâwe, emihigo yâwe yâyunjula obwo.<verse eid="PRO 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 16:4"/>Nyakasane àjizire ngasi kantu erhi anamanyire ecirhumire, ciru n’enkola-maligo yâlemerwa olusiku luhanya.<verse eid="PRO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 16:5"/>Bishwêka omu masù ga Nyakasane, omurhima gw’akagayo, owa bene oyo barhâmusige ciru.<verse eid="PRO 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 16:6"/>Olukogo lw’oburhabêsha bwo bulyûla ebyâha, okurhînya Nyakasane kwo omuntu ayâkamwo obubî.<verse eid="PRO 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 16:7"/>Nyakasane akarhonya obwôrhere bw’omuntu, anamuliranye ciru n’abashombanyi bâge.<verse eid="PRO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 16:8"/>Ehinyi hy’omu budahemuka, hyo hikulu oku binji by’obungunganya.<verse eid="PRO 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 16:9"/>Omurhima gw’omuntu gwo gucîshoga enjira, ci kwône Nyakasane ye sêza amagulu g’omuntu omu njira?<verse eid="PRO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abâmi Nyamuzinda bagwâsa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 16:10"/>Omu kanwa ka mwâmi mwo murhenga akanwa, nk’atwa olubanja akanwa kâge karhahalabuka.<verse eid="PRO 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 16:11"/>Omunzâni n’ensahani z’obushinganyanya: bya Nyakasane, ciru n’obuzirho bwa sunzu: nabo mukolo gwâge.<verse eid="PRO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 16:12"/>Ecishologosa abâmi: kukola amaligo, bulyâla obushinganyanya go makondo g’entebe.<verse eid="PRO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 16:13"/>Kanwa ka bashinganyanya karhona ebwâmi, mwâmi asîma oderha ebishingânîne.<verse eid="PRO 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 16:14"/>Oburhè bwa mwâmi, ntumwa ya lufù, murhimanya oburhûza.<verse eid="PRO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 16:15"/>Oyu obusù bwa mwâmi bwashekera erhi amâlama, n’olukogo lwâge kwo luyôrha nka nkuba ezinda nyuma.<verse eid="PRO 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 16:16"/>Aha omuntu ankarhôla amasholo ankarhôla oburhimanya, n’aha omuntu ankabona amarhale ankabona obwîrhonzi.<verse eid="PRO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 16:17"/>Enjira y’abashinganyanya kunali kuyâka abagoma, omuntu ocîrhega-rhega ye langa akalamo kâge.<verse eid="PRO 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 16:18"/>Kagayo kashokolera okurhibuka, n’omuhîmbo gw’omuntu gwo gushokolera okuhunguluka.<verse eid="PRO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 16:19"/>Aha omuntu ankashangîra omunyago n’abagayana, ankacîbêra mugunda omu banyînyi.<verse eid="PRO 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 16:20"/>Oyumvîrhiza bwinja ihano linamucize, n’ocîkubagira Nyakasane ali muny’iragi.<verse eid="PRO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 16:21"/>Ow’omurhima mwîrhonzi ye baderha murhimanya, n’omutûdu omu binwa ye derha ebyayumvûbwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 16:22"/>Obwîrhonzi kuciza buciza nnabwo, isirhe ly’abahwinja bwo na buhane bwâbo.<verse eid="PRO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 16:23"/>Murhima gwa mwîrhonzi gurhuma aderha akanwa kashingânîne, gwo gunarhuma aderha ebyayumvûbwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 16:24"/>Iderha linjà cigukulu ca bûci, linanune ekanwa licize n’omubiri.<verse eid="PRO 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 16:25"/>Hali enjira eboneka nnungêdu, ebulizinda erhi ekuzimu yahêka.<verse eid="PRO 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 16:26"/>Ishali ly’omukozi ye linakolera, bulyâla iralà akanwa kayumvîrhe lyanamusêza.<verse eid="PRO 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda ye Lugaba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 16:27"/>Omuntu wa busha busha anazûse obuhanya, akanwa kâge kabâkwo oguli nka muliro batwânyire.<verse eid="PRO 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 16:28"/>Ow’endyâlya ntambala anatula, n’ow’omwanzi kukoza anakoza aha ayinjibîne.<verse eid="PRO 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 16:29"/>Ow’ebihalârhi anarhebe owâbo, amugeze omu njira erhali yo.<verse eid="PRO 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 16:30"/>Ozibire mpu lyo agerêreza obulyâlya, olumire amîno, akozire amaligo<verse eid="PRO 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 16:31"/>Okumera emvi, kuyambala ecimanè c’okukengwa, mwo ciboneka omu njira y’obushinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 16:32"/>Omuntu orhûza ye mukulu oku ntwâli, n’ohira omurhima omu nda, ye mukulu hali cirimisi wanyaga ebihugo.<verse eid="PRO 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 16:33"/>Omu mubungo gw’omwambalo bahira obuhanya, obucîranuzi bubà bwa Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="PRO 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PRO 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Obwîrhonzi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 17:1"/>Ecikâmbi c’omugati mûmu omuntu alya n’omurhûla, co cikulu aha nyumpa eyunjwîre nyama z’enterekêro y’omu mbaka.<verse eid="PRO 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 17:2"/>Omushizi mwenge ye mukulu hali bene nnakâ basirhe, âyishishangîra akashambala haguma nabo.<verse eid="PRO 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 17:3"/>Omuliro gurhangula amarhale, n’ecibêye amasholo. emirhima yôhe Nyakasane oyirhangula.<verse eid="PRO 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 17:4"/>Omumînya akanwa kabî ko ayumvîrhiza, n’omurhebanyi kanwa kanywesi ayumvîrhiza.<verse eid="PRO 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 17:5"/>Oshekera omukenyi erhi Omulemi wâge agayisize, n’oshekera ohanyagîre, arhabula kuhanwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 17:6"/>Ecimanè c’abashosi: bâna b’abâna bâbo, okukengwa kw’abâna erhi îshe.<verse eid="PRO 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 17:7"/>lderha lirhakwânana musirhe, nalwo lulimi lunywesi, lurhahimwa kushuha omuluzi<verse eid="PRO 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 17:8"/>Omu masù g’oyihâbirwe, entanda ebà njuma ya citwîro cidârhi.<verse eid="PRO 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 17:9"/>Obwikira ecibî c’owundi erhi bwîra akomire, ci ojà aderha ecibî ca bene anashombanye abà ayinjibine.<verse eid="PRO 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 17:10"/>Okukalihirwa kuyumvîsa omwenge, n’eminyuli ikumi ebule buyumvîsa idâga.<verse eid="PRO 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 17:11"/>Omubî arhalonza oburhali bugoma, ci muganda mumînya banamurhumira.<verse eid="PRO 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 17:12"/>Aha omuntu ankashigâna omusirhe ogurusire. ankabugâna mpunga banyazire abâna.<verse eid="PRO 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 17:13"/>Ogalula obubî oku bwinjà, obuhanya burhankarhenga aha mwâge.<verse eid="PRO 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 17:14"/>Okuzûsa olubanja kubà kufukulira amîshi, onacîzibuke lwo lurhacikula.<verse eid="PRO 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 17:15"/>Okulîka omugoma, n’okutumuza omwêru-kwêru, bibirhi Nyakasane ashomba ebyo.<verse eid="PRO 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 17:16"/>Obugale omu nfune z’omuhwinja erhi bwa bici? Ka mpu agule mwo oburhimanya? Ci arhajira irhwe!<verse eid="PRO 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 17:17"/>Mwîra wa muntu ôbà amuzigire ngasi mango, kw’anabà nka mwene wâbo omuntu omu mbaka.<verse eid="PRO 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 17:18"/>Ali muhwinja omuntu oshiga haguma n’owâbo agalibà ye cihana yêne ncungura.<verse eid="PRO 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 17:19"/>Okusîma akadali kubà kusîma empîmbo, n’olengeza izù erhi kushâba alonza. <verse eid="PRO 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 17:20"/>Ow’omurhima mubî arhabêrwa, n’ow’akalimi kuhanyagala ahanyagala.<verse eid="PRO 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhwinja burhabukwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 17:21"/>Oburha omuhwinja mutula aburhira, ntà kushagaluka kw’îshe w’ecingolo-ngolo.<verse eid="PRO 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 17:22"/>Omurhima gurhwangûsire, bufumu nkana, murhima-ali mungo, anayumye omuntu orhuvuha.<verse eid="PRO 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 17:23"/>Endyâlya enalye bufûnda-fûnda, entânda y’okuhabula obushinganyanya, <verse eid="PRO 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 17:24"/>Entagengwa ebwa burhimanya eyerekeza amalanga, amasù g’omuhwinja gôhe, kuzimêra gazimêra enyuma ly’ebihugo.<verse eid="PRO 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 17:25"/>Omwâna muhwinja mutula gw’îshe, gwo na mungo gw’omuzîre wamuburhaga. <verse eid="PRO 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 17:26"/>Kurhabà kwinjà okuhôngesa omushinganyanya, n’okushûrha abarhambo kuciri kubî kulusha.<verse eid="PRO 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 17:27"/>Omuntu ogera ebinwa byâge erhi amanyire, n’ow’omurhima mwîrhonzi ye mwenge.<verse eid="PRO 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 17:28"/>Ciru n’omusirhe akahulika naye anabonekane nka mugula, orhabumbwîre akanwa anabonekane nka mwenge.<verse eid="PRO 17:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PRO 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuhwinja isirhe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 18:1"/>Owayîrha obwîra arhabula ngwârhiro, ngasi ihano erhi na libî.<verse eid="PRO 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 18:2"/>Omuhwinja arhadôsa mirhima, ci asîma bamanye ngasi kumuli emurhima.<verse eid="PRO 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 18:3"/>Ah’obulyâlya bwajire harhabula kagayo, owatûha kutumula arhenga.<verse eid="PRO 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 18:4"/>Ebinwa by’omurhimanya, nyânja ya mogôge, nshôko ya buzîne, lwîshi luyunjwîre.<verse eid="PRO 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 18:5"/>Kurhabà kwinjà okuyumva endyâlya, n’okuyâgîsa omurhimanya omu kutwa olubanja,<verse eid="PRO 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 18:6"/>Olulimi lw’ecinganyi lunacihêke ekagômbe, n’akanwa kaco kanatule entembala.<verse eid="PRO 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 18:7"/>Ecinganyi kanwa kaco kaciyisa, n’olulimi lwâco, gubâ murhego guyôrha gucîrhezire.<verse eid="PRO 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 18:8"/>Ebinwa by’omwanzi gw’obunywesi, kwo biri nka bihimbi bya nyama nnûnu, binywengerera omu nda kuhika kuli nya-mulà.<verse eid="PRO 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 18:9"/>Ngasi oyôlohera omukolo, ye muguma bône kashâba.<verse eid="PRO 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 18:10"/>Izîno lya Nyakasane ye: Nkingi-nzibu. mwo omushinganyanya ayâkira barhanacimuhikekwo.<verse eid="PRO 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 18:11"/>Omugale ebirugu byâge lwo na lwâkiro lwâge, oku bwâge mpu côgo cizibu cimuzônzire.<verse eid="PRO 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 18:12"/>Omurhima gw’omuntu nka gwasherera, kuhimba gurhânga, ci nka gwajà irenge kurhôha gurhanga.<verse eid="PRO 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omurhima ye muntu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 18:13"/>Oshuza arhanaciyûmva, kuyêrekana ayêrekana obuhwinja bwamubonêsa nshonyi;<verse eid="PRO 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 18:14"/>Endwâla, omurhima gw’omuntu gwanayirembera, ci omurhima omuntu amârhiba, ndi wankaguzûsa?<verse eid="PRO 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 18:15"/>Omurhima gw’omurhimanya gukûnda ihano, okurhwiri kw’abarhimanya kusîma kuyumve bwinjà.<verse eid="PRO 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 18:16"/>Nyalulêrha ntà lûmvi arhigula, anahike ciru n’omu masù g’abakulu.<verse eid="PRO 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 18:17"/>Orhangiderha aha ngombe ye bahà n’olubanja, erhi owâbo ayisha balushubiremwo.<verse eid="PRO 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuyîrha n’okuciza, olulimi lukugwêrhe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 18:18"/>Kuyêsha cigole kutwa akadali; kwo kunafunga ba-ciri-misî.<verse eid="PRO 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 18:19"/>Omuntu orhabirwe na mwene wâbo, kw’ali nka lugo luyûbake buzibu, n’abîra kwo bali nka kahamikizo kazibu-zibu.<verse eid="PRO 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 18:20"/>Mukolo gwa kanwa wanda ayigurha, omuntu, mukolo gwa kanwa kâge ashêga.<verse eid="PRO 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 18:21"/>Okuyîrha n’okuciza, olulimi lukugwêrhe, abalusîma bayumva eci lubâmwo. <verse eid="PRO 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 18:22"/>Owabwîne omukazi erhi hinjà arhôzire, erhi ngalo ya Nyakasane abwîne.<verse eid="PRO 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 18:23"/>Iderha ly’omuganda, kusengera; omugale arhashuza n’oburhali bukali.<verse eid="PRO 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 18:24"/>Hali abîra bakenya omuntu, hali n’abà omuntu arhonya kulusha mwene wâbo.<verse eid="PRO 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PRO 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Dibi-dibi garhali magulu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 19:1"/>Omuganda orhali mudahemuka ye mukulu, oku mugale w’omusirhe na wa kanwa kabî.<verse eid="PRO 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 19:2"/>Obushiru burhagerêreza burhali bwo, n’amagulu mabidu-mabidu ganahabuke.<verse eid="PRO 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 19:3"/>Obuhwinja bw’omuntu bunamusherêgeze amâjira, omurhima gwâge gubâge Nyakasane ye gutumuza.<verse eid="PRO 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 19:4"/>Obugale buluza abîra, omukenyi yêhe ciru n’omwîra muguma anamuyâke.<verse eid="PRO 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 19:5"/>Omuhamîrizi w’obunywesi ârhakabula buhanwa, naye kanywesi yêne ârhakafuma buhane.<verse eid="PRO 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 19:6"/>Omuntu ohâna, banji bamusengera, ohâna boshi bamurhonya.<verse eid="PRO 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 19:7"/>Erhi bene wâbo omuntu wamâkena bamushomba boshi, kurhi abîra bâge boki bankabulaga bwamuyâka.<verse eid="PRO 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 19:8"/>Owabwîne ahika oku mûka, anacîtakîre, n’omuntu okola n’oburhimanya ye bandâna obucire.<verse eid="PRO 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhuza kw’omugula</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 19:9"/>Omuhamîrizi w’obunywesi arhabula buhanwa, naye kanywesi yêne, kuhera ânahere.<verse eid="PRO 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 19:10"/>Obwigusi burhakwânana musirhe, omujà naye kushuhwa ashuhwa n’okurhegeka ba nnawâbo.<verse eid="PRO 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 19:11"/>Oburhimanya bw’omulume bumanyirwa oku kurhûza kwâge, n’irenge lyâge lirhalibirhira ebigalu-galu.<verse eid="PRO 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 19:12"/>Okukaliha kwa mwâmi kwo kuyôrha nka mululumo gwa ngoromora, okurhonya kwâge kwo kuyôrha nka lumè oku byâsi.<verse eid="PRO 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 19:13"/>Omwâna muhwinja buhanya bw’îshe, omukazi w’embaka kw’ali nka mirhônyi yarhoga oku nyumpa burhahusa.<verse eid="PRO 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 19:14"/>Enyumpa y’ebirugu, kashambala k’îshe wa muntu, ci omukazi mwîrhonzi, ngalo ya Nyakasane.<verse eid="PRO 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 19:15"/>Obwôlo njingo buvuna, murhima mwângu, arhafuma ishali.<verse eid="PRO 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Murhima mwinjà omuntu asîmirwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 19:16"/>Olanga amarhegeko kucîlanga acilânga yêne, ci omuntu olekerera enjira yâge kufâ ajifâ.<verse eid="PRO 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 19:17"/>Obabalira omukenyi erhi Nyakasane abîsize, yêne ye wâjuhe.<verse eid="PRO 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 19:18"/>Ohane mugala wâwe liciri duba, ci kwône orhacîhiraga oku ntuli y’okumuyîrha.<verse eid="PRO 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 19:19"/>Omukali yêne ocijira, okumulekerera kunali kuyûshûla obuhanya bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 19:20"/>Oyumve ihano onaleke bakuhakanye, lyo ozinda oli murhimanya.<verse eid="PRO 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 19:21"/>Emihigo y’omurhima gw’omuntu eluga, ci omuhigo gwa Nyakasane gwo gusêra.<verse eid="PRO 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 19:22"/>Murhima mwinjà omuntu asîmirwa, n’omukenyi ye mukulu aha munywesi.<verse eid="PRO 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 19:23"/>Okurhînya Nyakasane ebà njira ya kalamo, ecimubâ co cinamubâ, n’omubâ arhaganya buligo.<verse eid="PRO 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhanûla</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 19:24"/>Omwôlo analikire okuboko oku cishanjo, arhânakuhise ciru n’ekanwa.<verse eid="PRO 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 19:25"/>Shûrha ogayana, omuhwinja ayengehe, kalihira omwenge akûlemwo ihano.<verse eid="PRO 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 19:26"/>Okolera Îshe amaligo akanahulusa nnina, ali mwâna muhanya na muhehêrere.<verse eid="PRO 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 19:27"/>Mwâna wâni, olekage n’okuyumva amahano, akabà kuyâka walonza okuyâka ebinwa by’oburhimanya.<verse eid="PRO 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 19:28"/>Muhamiriza mubî oshekera abashamuka e kagombe, akanwa k’endyâlya kugulinjika kagulinjika amaligo.<verse eid="PRO 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 19:29"/>Akarhi kanali ka kuhana abagambana, n’empîmbo zibà zirinzire omugongo gw’abahwinja.<verse eid="PRO 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PRO 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Omwenge anayâke endalwè, obukali n’obwôlo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 20:1"/>Idivayi liyishi oku lishekera omulume, n’amamvu galuza akadugundu; ocîrhegago ntà burhimanya agwêrhe.<verse eid="PRO 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 20:2"/>Okukaliha kwa mwâmi, kwo kuyôrha nka mululumo gwa ngoromora; omujira burhè anacîzûkize nyammanjà.<verse eid="PRO 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 20:3"/>Buli bulume okuyogôlo embaka, muhwinja ocihîra muli zo.<verse eid="PRO 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 20:4"/>Omwôlo arhahinga nk’abandi bâhinga, nka bakola basârûla ye murhanzi, ci lêrhaga!<verse eid="PRO 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 20:5"/>Ihano omu murhima gw’omuntu, kwo liri nka mugemero mulîri, mwo omwenge âgendidômera. Ntà mwinjà obûla ishêmbo<verse eid="PRO 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 20:6"/>Bantu banji bacîderha binjà, ci omwikubagirwa ndi wankamubona?<verse eid="PRO 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 20:7"/>Omushinganyanya, ilabarha lyâge, lya mudahemuka; abâna asiga, abasiga bany’iragi.<verse eid="PRO 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 20:8"/>Mwâmi otamîre aha kagombe mmanja àtwa, ajira amasù gayêrûla ngasi hibî.<verse eid="PRO 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 20:9"/>Ndi wankaderha, erhi: «omurhima gwâni gucîre, ntayimbwâkwo câha»? <verse eid="PRO 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 20:10"/>Obuzirho oku bwâbo, omulengo oku gundi, bibirhi Nyakasane arhakwirirwa ebyo.<verse eid="PRO 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 20:11"/>Amashârha gw’omwâna murhò, ganayêrekane erhi ebijiro byâge byâyishibà bya bucêse n’obushinganyanya. Birharhenga aharhali kanwa kinjà<verse eid="PRO 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 20:12"/>Okurhwiri kuyumva, n’isù libona, byombi Nyakasane wabijiraga.<verse eid="PRO 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 20:13"/>Omanye orharhonyagya îrò wankanakena, ozibûke waluza ebiryo orhaluse.<verse eid="PRO 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 20:14"/>«Birhali byo, birhali byo», gwârhi owâgula, kurhânahangè arhaja acîshinga.<verse eid="PRO 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 20:15"/>Banasîme amasholo n’omwandu gw’amagerha, ci kwône ntâco cikwanana omuntu nka kanwa kamanyire emyanzi.<verse eid="PRO 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwîrhonzi bulwa amatumu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 20:16"/>Omunyâge ecirondo bulyâla acîhânyire ncungura oku w’ihanga, na kuli oyu orhamanyiri omuhûnekwoye ecikinja.<verse eid="PRO 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 20:17"/>Omugati gw’obushuma guyishi oku gununira omuntu, erhi gucîbûmba akanwa gushube mushênyi!<verse eid="PRO 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 20:18"/>Omuhigo mahano ga bandi gaguzibuhya, n’amatumu bwîrhonzi bugalwa.<verse eid="PRO 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 20:19"/>Ow’akalimi anabase amahwe, orhahîra okakômera oderha bwenêne. <verse eid="PRO 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 20:20"/>Oderha îshe na nnina buligo, ânazimirwe n’akamole omu ndunduli y’omwizimya.<verse eid="PRO 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 20:21"/>Obugale burhangira duba n’okukula duba, bunazinde erhi burhacibona mugisho.<verse eid="PRO 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîkubagira Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 20:22"/>Orhaderhaga, erhi: «nacîhôla», ocîkubagire Nyakasane yêne âkulîkûza.<verse eid="PRO 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 20:23"/>Nyakasane ashomba obuzirho oku bundi, omunzâni bagolongohize gurhahimwa kubîha.<verse eid="PRO 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 20:24"/>Nyakasane yêne olangûla amagulu gw’omuntu enjira, kurhi omuntu ankacîderheraga mpu amanya bwinjà enjira alimwo?<verse eid="PRO 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 20:25"/>Guli murhego oku muntu okuhamagaza erhi: «eyi eri nterekêro!» n’enyuma ly’eciragâne acîganye. Omûka kamole kamoleka omurhima<verse eid="PRO 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 20:26"/>Omwâmi murhimanya kuyêrûla ayêrûla enkolamaligo, abulibarhogeza-kwo amaligo gâbo.<verse eid="PRO 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 20:27"/>Omûka gw’omuntu kabà kamole ka Nyakasane, kamoleka omuntu yêshi kuhika oku nyômvu y’omurhima.<verse eid="PRO 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 20:28"/>Obukenge n’obudahemukira mwâmi bo balanzi bamulanga; obukenge byo bikondo by’entebe yâge.<verse eid="PRO 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 20:29"/>Buzibu basimira abâna b’emisole, n’abashosi mvi bakengerwa.<verse eid="PRO 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 20:30"/>Ebibande byajababa mukò bwo bufumu buhasha obumînya, empîmbo aha nsholo y’omurhima zihika.<verse eid="PRO 20:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PRO 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Okukola ebishingânîne</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 21:1"/>Omurhima gwa mwâmi kwo guli omu nfune za Nyakasane nka mugezi gwa mîshi, emunda alonzize yo anaguhengulira.<verse eid="PRO 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 21:2"/>Omu masù g’omuntu yêne, enjira zâge zoshi zishingânîne, ci Nyakasane yêhe mirhima ahombaganya.<verse eid="PRO 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 21:3"/>Okukola ebishingânîne bikwânîne omu masù ga Nyakasane, kwo kukulu aha nterekêro.<verse eid="PRO 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 21:4"/>Okulolera abandi oku cirhugo kugayana, enkola-maligo erhakola agarhali maligo.<verse eid="PRO 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 21:5"/>Omwîrhonzi murhima adôsa na kuyunguka ayunguka, ebya duba-duba cizombo binafulusa.<verse eid="PRO 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 21:6"/>Obugale burhenga omu bunywesi cihemu, oku burhimanga kwo bunali bwa mihera yalonza olufù.<verse eid="PRO 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 21:7"/>Obulala bw’enkola-maligo bwo bwânazihezè, bulyâla zàlahire bwakola ebishingânîne.<verse eid="PRO 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rhinga bwinjà bwônene bujirwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 21:8"/>Enjira y’enkola-maligo erhashongera, ebijiro by’entagengwa byôhe bibà bishongire.<verse eid="PRO 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 21:9"/>Aha omuntu ankabêra haguma n’omukazi w’embaka, ankacijira oku kanshôsho k’enyumpa.<verse eid="PRO 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 21:10"/>Enkola-maligo erhalongeza bandi kalamo, aha bwâge owâbo arhankababalirwa.<verse eid="PRO 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 21:11"/>Bakahana omugambanyi, omunyi anabè murhimanya, n’omurhimanya bakamuhanûla anayengehe.<verse eid="PRO 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 21:12"/>Omushinganyanya analolêreza enyumpa y’endyâlya; abulindike enkola-maligo omu buhanya.<verse eid="PRO 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 21:13"/>Ofuka amarhwîri mpu arhagiyumva izù ly’omukenyi, naye ânaciyâme abule n’ecishuzize.<verse eid="PRO 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 21:14"/>Ebihânwa bushâla-shâla binarhûze oburhè, n’ebihânwa bufunda-funda binarhûze obukali.<verse eid="PRO 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 21:15"/>Oku mushinganyanya, okukola ebishingânîne kulyâ ntânda, ci, oku nkola-maligo, kurhahimwa câbà. Ow’amîru arhagala<verse eid="PRO 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 21:16"/>Ocikûla omu njira y’obwîrhonzi omu ndêko y’abalinda-mboho afuduka akola ali.<verse eid="PRO 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 21:17"/>Ow’amîru arhagala, ntâkwo agale omuntu osîma amamvu n’amashushi.<verse eid="PRO 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 21:18"/>Enkola-maligo yo ncungulà y’entagengwa, n’endyâlya yo ebà ncungulà y’abashinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 21:19"/>Abà wankabêra nyumpa nguma n’omukazi w’embaka oyôrha arhûnzize, wankacîbêrera omu cihugo cirhabâmwo ndi.<verse eid="PRO 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 21:20"/>Abà mw’omurhimanya habâ ebinja, habâ n’amavurha, omuhwinja yêhe abishandâze.<verse eid="PRO 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 21:21"/>Okulikira enjira y’obushinganyanya n’ey’olukogo, ye hika oku kalamo n’oku irenge.<verse eid="PRO 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 21:22"/>Omurhimanya ànahime olugo lw’entwâli, anahongole olwâkiro bacîkubagira.<verse eid="PRO 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 21:23"/>Olanga akanwa n’olulimi lwâge, oku mutula acilanga.<verse eid="PRO 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Banyamakobwa bali banji</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 21:24"/>Izîno ly’omuntu ogambana, onagayana: ye Nyamakobwa, ngasi ebi akola kagayo abikolamwo.<verse eid="PRO 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 21:25"/>Enyifinjo z’omwôlo kuyîrha ziyîrha, bulyâla enfune zâge zirhaziga zakola.<verse eid="PRO 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 21:26"/>Enkola-maligo enalegerere yacîfinja ebya bene, oku omushinganyanya abâna ebyâge.<verse eid="PRO 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 21:27"/>Enterekêro enkola-maligo zirherekêra erhi na bishwêka, k’olânga lyôhe bakazirherekêra n’omurhima guhizire amaligo.<verse eid="PRO 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 21:28"/>Ohamîriza obunywesi erhi muhera, ci omuntu orhangiyumvirhiza ye manyiderha.<verse eid="PRO 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 21:29"/>Endyâlya busù bukulu eciha, omushinganyanya yêhe kulola aj’alola aha âgera.<verse eid="PRO 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 21:30"/>Ntà burhimanya, ntà bwîrhonzi, na nt’ihano lyankacigererakwo Nyamubâho.<verse eid="PRO 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 21:31"/>Olusiku lw'okulwa, abantu biterusi barheganya, ci kwône Nyamuzinda ye boshi banasengera mpu abahimire.<verse eid="PRO 21:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PRO 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Okubâ n’izîno linjà</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 22:1"/>Aha wankaluza ebirugu, wankajira izîno nkana, aha wakashegema amarhale n’amasholo, wankajà irenge.<verse eid="PRO 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 22:2"/>Omugale n’omugunda babugânîne mw’oku: bombi Nyakasane wabalemaga.<verse eid="PRO 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 22:3"/>Omwenge akabona obuhanya anabuyâke, abahwinja bôhe mpu barharhaluka, bayandûle.<verse eid="PRO 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 22:4"/>Oluhembo lw’obwîrhôhye n’okurhînya Nyakasane, bubà irenge n’akalamo.<verse eid="PRO 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebikwânana izîno ly’omuntu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 22:5"/>Mishûgi n’emirhego omu njira y’ababî, omuntu ocîlanzire yêhe kuyâka ayiyâka.<verse eid="PRO 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 22:6"/>Oyigîrize omwâna wâwe enjira âgeramwo, âbà akola mushosi erhi yo anacibâmwo.<verse eid="PRO 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 22:7"/>Mugale orhegeka abakenyi, ohûna mpu bamuhoze, ye mujà w’owamuhozagya.<verse eid="PRO 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 22:8"/>Orhwêra amaligo buhanya ahaka, karhî ka burhè bwâge kamushurha.<verse eid="PRO 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 22:9"/>Ayâgirwe mâshi omuntu ôbà lukogo, omuntu ohâ mukenyi oku cijumbu!<verse eid="PRO 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 22:10"/>Ohuluse omugambanyi entambala ehwe; embaka n’ebijâci byanarhûla.<verse eid="PRO 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 22:11"/>Nyakasane arhonya emirhima ecîre, oyishiderha ye mwâmi arhonya.<verse eid="PRO 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 22:12"/>Masù ga Nyakasane galanga omurhimanya, ci kwône ebinwa by’endyâlya ye bibula-buza.<verse eid="PRO 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebibihya izîno</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 22:13"/>Omwôlo nk’aderha, mpu: «entale eri embuga», erhi: «banyîrhira omu muhanda».<verse eid="PRO 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 22:14"/>Akanwa k’abakazi b’embuga ebà nyènga, oyu Nyakasane ashombire ye yirhogeramwo.<verse eid="PRO 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 22:15"/>Obuhwinja bubà bunanîre oku murhima gw’omwâna, akarhi k’obuhane kanamulikûze kuli bwo.<verse eid="PRO 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 22:16"/>Okurhindibuza omukenyi kubà kumugaza, n’okushobôza omugale kubà kumukenya.<verse eid="PRO 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">III. Ebinwa by’abarhimanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 22:17"/>Binwa bya burhimanya, orhege ebinwa byâni okurhwiri, orhege omurhima ly’obimanya bwinjà.<verse eid="PRO 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 22:18"/>Bulyâla wâyumva osîmire okubibîkirira oku murhima gwâwe, n’okubona byoshi bikuli ngasi mango omu kanwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 22:19"/>Kuderha nti okaziyôrha ocîkubagire Nyakasane, kwo kurhumire nalonza okukumanyîsa ene enjira washimba.<verse eid="PRO 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 22:20"/>Ka ntabonaga nakuyandikira bigabi makumi asharhu, bya mahano n’obulenga?<verse eid="PRO 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 22:21"/>Kuderha, nti omanye okunali, onahashishuza n’ebinwa bikwânîne ngasi yêshi wakudôsa.<verse eid="PRO 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 22:22"/>Orhanyagiraga omukenyi okubâ mukenyi, n’ohanyagîre orhamulibulizagya aha lûmvi.<verse eid="PRO 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 22:23"/>Bulya Nyakasane ye basambira, n’abahaguzi, yêhe mûka abahêka.<verse eid="PRO 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 22:24"/>Orhayinjibanaga omuntu okunira bwenêne, orhakaz’îgigenda n’omuntu ôbà burhè duba.<verse eid="PRO 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 22:25"/>Wakanayîga enjira zâge, obone wamâfâ.<verse eid="PRO 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 22:26"/>Orhabâga wa muli balya bashurha omu nfune, bacîhâna cikinja oku myenda.<verse eid="PRO 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 22:27"/>Erhi wankabà orhagwêrhi ebi wâjuha, banakunyonyôla n’encingo ogwîshirakwo.<verse eid="PRO 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 22:28"/>Orhahîra okahindula olubibi lwa mîra, oku abashakulûza bâwe bàtwaga.<verse eid="PRO 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 22:29"/>K’obwîne omuntu mubidu omu kukola? Ye wankakolera mwâmi oyo, arhakayôrha akolera abantu kwône.<verse eid="PRO 22:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PRO 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Omushigo gurhahasha ngasi mulume</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 23:1"/>Nk’oli oku cîbo mweshi n’omukulu, onalole bwinjà ehiri embere zâwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 23:2"/>Akabà odambiha, ohire akêre aha mumiro gwâwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 23:3"/>Orhacîfinjaga ebiryo byâge by’olununîrizi, hyankanaba biryo bya kurhebana.<verse eid="PRO 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwônganwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 23:4"/>Orhacîrhamagya mpu walwira okuhirhira, oleke n’okuyungukira oku bandi.<verse eid="PRO 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 23:5"/>Obuhirhi obukonolîre amasù, orhabubwîni. Bulyâla kwo bujira ebyûbi nk’ikozi, lyo liyâkira oku nkuba.<verse eid="PRO 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 23:6"/>Orhahîra okalîra haguma n’omwônganwa, orhahîra okacîfinja ebiryo byâge;<verse eid="PRO 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 23:7"/>Bulya ebi âgerereza emurhima gwâge, ye nyamuderha erhi: «mâshi lyaga onasûze», n’obwo omurhima gwâge gurhakulikwo.<verse eid="PRO 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 23:8"/>Wâshala ehi wamâmira, obone wamaheza ebinwa binjà wacikazâg’iderha.<verse eid="PRO 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahano gw’obulezi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 23:9"/>Irhondo orhahîraga okaderhera omu kurhwiri kw’ecingolo-ngolo, cankanagayaguza oburhimanya bw’ebinwa byâwe.<verse eid="PRO 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 23:10"/>Orhahîraga okahindula olubibi lwa mîra, orhayankaga n’amashwa g’enfûzi,<verse eid="PRO 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 23:11"/>bulyâla Ogala-byoshi ye mwihôzi wâbo, ye wânayanka olubanja lwâbo akuyâgîrize.<verse eid="PRO 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 23:12"/>Omurhima gwâwe ogurhegêre, gurhegêre ihano, n’amarhwîri gâwe ogarhege ebinwa by’abalenga.<verse eid="PRO 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 23:13"/>Orhahîraga okababalira omwâna mpu orhâmuhana, bulyâla erhi wankamushûrha, akarhi karhâmuyîrhe.<verse eid="PRO 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 23:14"/>Kàli ciru okamushûrha akarhi karhankamuyîrha, kwakûla omûka gwâge ekuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oburhimanya n’omurhima</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 23:15"/>Mwâna, wâni, erhi wankanabà ogwêrhe omurhima gw’oburhimanya, nâni ogwâni murhima gwanarhimûkwa.<verse eid="PRO 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 23:16"/>Obulâ bundi omu nda bwanarhâmba, bubona akâwe kanwa kâderha ebishingânîne.<verse eid="PRO 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 23:17"/>Omurhima gwâwe gurhayâgalagwa n’enkola-maligo, ci guyôrhe gurhînya Nyakasane ngasi mango.<verse eid="PRO 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 23:18"/>Bulyâla irhondo ho liri, n’obulangâlire bwâwe burhâfanânde.<verse eid="PRO 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 23:19"/>Nkubwîre mwâna wâni, obè murhimanya, onayêrekeze omurhima gwâwe omu njira nnungêdu.<verse eid="PRO 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 23:20"/>Orhahîraga okakerekera ekarhî ka ba-cambali-nzoga, nîsi erhi ekarhî k’abaziga enyama,<verse eid="PRO 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 23:21"/>bulyâla abanywi bakulu n’ab’amîru banacîkenye, n’obwôlo bunarhume omuntu ayambala obwikûnjè.<verse eid="PRO 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 23:22"/>Okaziyûmva sho wakuburhaga, orhanagayaga nyoko mpu akola mugikulu.<verse eid="PRO 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 23:23"/>Olonze okumanya okuli, ci orhabâga: «mpemba-nkubwîre» ocîhangâne omanye oburhimanya, ihano n’okumany’iyumva.<verse eid="PRO 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 23:24"/>Okubâ îshe w’omushinganyanya: kulya ntânda; okubâ îshe w’omurhimanya: busîme bunji.<verse eid="PRO 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 23:25"/>Orhangishagalusa sho, n’omuzîre wakuburhaga naye ashagaluka.<verse eid="PRO 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 23:26"/>Mwâna wâni, yumva nkubwîre; amasù gâwe gayêrekere amahano nâkuhà:<verse eid="PRO 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 23:27"/>Omukazi w’ecirala: lushâyo; n’omukazi w’embuga, iriba lya bunwa buhûnde!<verse eid="PRO 23:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 23:28"/>Bwifulikwè alinga nka cishûngu, na barhebwa banji ajira ekarhî k’abalume.<verse eid="PRO 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulalwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 23:29"/>Ba «namâhera», na ba «yajoowe» babà ba ndi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:29">Zibà za ndi entambala?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:29">Ebà ya ndi emirenge? Zibà za ndi empîmbo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 23:29">Gabâ ga ndi amasù g’ebirenge-renge?<verse eid="PRO 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 23:30"/>Bibà bya bala barharhenga aha c’âmamvu, bibà bya mudûmbi-orhashubûka.<verse eid="PRO 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 23:31"/>Orhahîra okakonolera amamvu amasù: mpu alà nka gayinjiha! Mpu alà nka gabirira bwinjà omu kabêhe, mpu alà oku gahona bunyi-bunyi!<verse eid="PRO 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 23:32"/>Ganazînde erhi galumana nka njoka, gakômole nka njoka ya mpiri!<verse eid="PRO 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 23:33"/>Amasù gâwe gabone ebingeru-ngeru obwo, n’omurhima gwâwe guderhe eby’amahabwe;<verse eid="PRO 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 23:34"/>Nâwe obè nka muntu ogwîshîre omu nyanja emuhengere, erhi nka muntu ogwîshîre oku murhi.<verse eid="PRO 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 23:35"/>«Banshûsire na ntaho hânduma! Bambambwîre, ntanayumvîrhe! Mangaci nazûka nshubihûna orhundi!»<verse eid="PRO 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PRO 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 24:1"/>Orhahîraga okayonganwa n’enkola-maligo, orhanalonzagya okuzikômera.<verse eid="PRO 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 24:2"/>Bulyâla omurhima gwâbo gurhagerêreza ebirhali bigalu-galu, n’akanwa kâbo karhahâna erhali mihigo mibî.<verse eid="PRO 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 24:3"/>Burhimanya omuntu ayûbakamwo enyumpa, bwîrhonzi omuntu ahûmbamwo eciriba câyo;<verse eid="PRO 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 24:4"/>Bushiru bubûmba enguli y’omuntu, bîra binjà-binjà byoshi bija ecibuye.<verse eid="PRO 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 24:5"/>Aha omuntu ankaluza emisî ankaluza oburhimanya, aha ankabà ciri-misî, ankabà mulenga.<verse eid="PRO 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 24:6"/>Bulyâla kuyêsha kwinjà emirhima: kuhima ntambala, n’okubâ na bahanûzi banji kwo kuhimira omuntu.<verse eid="PRO 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 24:7"/>Omuhwinja mpu oburhimanya buli enyanya bwenêne, arhanabumbûla kanwa aha ngombe.<verse eid="PRO 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 24:8"/>Olonza okujira amabî, ye baderha cishûngu!<verse eid="PRO 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 24:9"/>Omuhwinja arhalôrha ebirhali bibî, n’omugambanyi, abandi barhamubâkwo.<verse eid="PRO 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 24:10"/>Akabà warhibire omurhima olusiku lw’amarhangulo, erhi obuzibu bwâwe bunali ntabwo.<verse eid="PRO 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 24:11"/>Ogalukire abâhêkwa ebwa lufù, ofungire n’abadwîrhwe nk’eyajibâgwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 24:12"/>Ka kwo wâyishiderha, erhi: kàli rhurhâli rhumanyire? K’orhamanyiri oku Olyâla olâba emirhima ntâco ahabire? K’orhamanyiri oku omulanzi olanga omurhima gwâwe, Oku arhahabiri bici? Ye wâhembe ngasi muguma nk’oku ànakozire.<verse eid="PRO 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 24:13"/>Okazirya oku bûci mwâna wâni, bulya bubà bwinjà, n’ebigukulu hy’obûci hirhahimwa kununa omu kanwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 24:14"/>Ntyo kwo n’oburhimanya nabwo buli omu murhima gwâwe, erhi wankabuhikakwo wanabona ensiku, n’obulangâlire bwâwe burhâfânandè.<verse eid="PRO 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 24:15"/>Orhahîraga okahira omurhego omu nyumpa y’omushinganya, orhanamushâbiraga enyumpa.<verse eid="PRO 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 24:16"/>Bulyâla kali nda omushinganyanya akulumba anashubizûka, ba-nyankola-maligo bôhe kugwa bagwa omu buhanya.<verse eid="PRO 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 24:17"/>Erhi omushombanyi wâwe ankakulumba, orhacîshingaga; omurhima gwâwe gurhasîmaga mpu obwenge amâsârhala.<verse eid="PRO 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 24:18"/>Nyakasane akanagaya omu kubona ntyo, obone arhacimurhûzirikwo mungo.<verse eid="PRO 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 24:19"/>Orhahîraga okalubira enkola-maligo, orhayâgalagwa n’endyâlya,<verse eid="PRO 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 24:20"/>Bulya ntà irhôndo ly’enkola-maligo: akamole k’endyâlya kuzima kanazima.<verse eid="PRO 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 24:21"/>Mwâna wâni, orhînye Nyakasane, orhînye na mwâmi, orhahîraga okajira oyu wagomera muli abwo bombi;<verse eid="PRO 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 24:22"/>Bulya obuhane bwâbo burhalâliza, na bulya, ndi omanyire citumule cici bâyishikuhirakwo bombi?<verse eid="PRO 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">IV. Ebindi binwa by’abarhimanya</para>
  <para style="s1">Okugwasanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 24:23"/>Ebi nabyo biri binwa bya barhimanya: Okulola ola ye ndi nka watwa olubanja, kurhabâ kwinjà.<verse eid="PRO 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 24:24"/>Obwîra omumînya mpu ali mushinganyanya, kuhehêrerwa ahehêrerwa n’amashanja, kugaywa anagaywa n’abandi.<verse eid="PRO 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 24:25"/>Ci kwône abatwa olubanja bwinjà, banayumve basîmire: mugisho banajâkwo.<verse eid="PRO 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 24:26"/>Omuntu wakushuze bwinjà<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuntu akakushuza bwinjà, onayumve oku akusîmire; nâwe onamusîme, n’ehinûnugurho nahyo bubà bwôrhere bwa kulamusanya emw’Abayahudi.</char></note>, erhi hinûnugurho akuhizire oku kanwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 24:27"/>Orheganyize omukolo gwâwe embuga, oshubija aho ohînge ishwa lyâwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lhano bahîre omwâna wajà omu buhya, nka kula bankanabwîra omuntu; mpu: «ohinge onayêze», «otule onabinje».</char></note>, wabona oku watunga enyumpa yâwe.<verse eid="PRO 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 24:28"/>Orhahîra okayêmêra duba obuhamîrizi bwayâgîriza omulungu, orhanahîra okarheba omuntu n’akâwe kanwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 24:29"/>Orhaderhaga, erhi: «nâmukolera ebi ànkolire! erhi nahà ngasi muguma nk’oku ànakozire»<verse eid="PRO 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwôlo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 24:30"/>Nageraga aha kw’omwôlo, abà ishwa ly’ecingolo-ngolo,<verse eid="PRO 24:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 24:31"/>Alà oku lyoshi lyàli limeziremwo omushadu, lyoshi lyàliyumjwire mishûgi, n’olugurhu-gurhu lw’amabuye erhi lwahongosire.<verse eid="PRO 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 24:32"/>Omu kubona ntyo nadôsa emirhima, okubona ebyo kwampà ezo nkengêro.<verse eid="PRO 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 24:33"/>Mpu «wârhangibunga hitya, warhangibâ nka waheba olugohe oku lundi, warhengibà nka wahira okuboko oku kwâbo, ocîhengeke»;<verse eid="PRO 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 24:34"/>«Oku ecizômbo cahanda aha mwâwe nka mubalama, n’ecizômbo cakutulikakwo amatumu!»<verse eid="PRO 24:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PRO 25"/>
  <para style="ms1">V. Ecitabu ca kabirhi c'emigani yayandikagwa na Salomoni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 25:1"/>Lâba eyindi migani ya Salomoni, yàyandikagwa na bambali ba Hezekiyahu, mwâmi w’e Yudeya.<verse eid="PRO 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 25:2"/>Okufulika omwanzi, libà irenge lya Nyamuzinda, ci okusholera olubanja libà irenge lya mwâmi.<verse eid="PRO 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 25:3"/>Amalunga go gabâ enyanya n’igulu lyo libà idako, omurhima gw’abâmi gwohe libà ishâmba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 25:3">Ebwâmi erhabêra orhali mwîrhonzi<verse eid="PRO 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 25:4"/>Ecûma, ocibalazekwo amazî g’ecûma, wabona oku cayisha cirî-cirî;<verse eid="PRO 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 25:5"/>Okûle endyâlya omu masù ga mwâmi wabona oku entebe yâge yasêra omu bushinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 25:6"/>Orhahîraga okacîhiramwo amakangarasa nk’oli omu masù ga mwâmi, orhanahîraga mpu wâjitamala halya h’abakulu-bakulu:<verse eid="PRO 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 25:7"/>Bulya aha bankakuyôza omu burhwâli, bankakubwîra mpu «ogere».</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 25:7">Ebi amasù gâwe gàbwîne, <verse eid="PRO 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 25:8"/>orhabihêkaga duba-duba aha kagombe, bulya kurhi okolaga wajira obwo, erhi owinyu ankakuyâgîriza?<verse eid="PRO 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 25:9"/>Olongôle mweshi n’owinyu, ci kwône orhabasagya ihwe lya bene;<verse eid="PRO 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 25:10"/>nnalyo akanakuyumva obone amâkugaya, nâwe wêne oheze olukengwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 25:11"/>Akanwa kalîke amango minjà, irehe lya masholo oku mbale y’amarhale.<verse eid="PRO 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 25:12"/>Ehigondo hy’amasholo n’enjuma y’amasholo gacîre, kwo binali nka kanwa k’omurhimanya wakalihira okurhwiri kwayumva.<verse eid="PRO 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 25:13"/>Omurhumwa mûmva, kw’ali omu masù g’owamurhumaga nka mîshi maholo-maholo amango bâsârûla, garhuliriz’omurhima.<verse eid="PRO 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 25:14"/>Omuntu ohâna omulagi arhâjirè, kw’ali nka bitù n’empûsi erhakulikîrwi na nkuba.<verse eid="PRO 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 25:15"/>Oburhûza bunarhume omurhambo agômba, olulimi lw’omuntu murhûza lunabeze akavuha.<verse eid="PRO 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 25:16"/>Erhi wankarhanga obûci, onalye oyîgurhe, ci kwône omanye wankacîhakabo, wankanagogwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 25:17"/>Orhahîraga okakômera enyumpa y’omulûngu, akanarhama obone mwamâshombana.<verse eid="PRO 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 25:18"/>Omuntu ohambâra omwalungwe, buli buhiri, ngôrho, mwampi mwôji.<verse eid="PRO 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 25:19"/>Okucîkubagira endyâlya olusiku luhanya, kunashube lîno libolo, kugulu kwâhegera.<verse eid="PRO 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 25:20"/>Okuhogola ensirha n’emboho eri, kubà kubulagira enkalishi oku cibânde, kuyimbira omurhima guli burhè.<verse eid="PRO 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 25:21"/>Omushombanyi wâwe erhi ankashalika, onamushalûle, erhi ankagwârhwa n’enyôrha, onamuhè anywe.<verse eid="PRO 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 25:22"/>Kuli kulunda amakala oku irhwe lyâge, Nyakasane akugalulira.<verse eid="PRO 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 25:23"/>Hali empûsi elêrha enkuba, olulimi lubà mwanzi nalwo lunalerhere omuntu oburhè.<verse eid="PRO 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 25:24"/>Abà omuntu ankabêra nyumpa nguma n’omukazi mudârhi, ankayûbaka oku kanshôsho k’enyumpa.<verse eid="PRO 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 25:25"/>Omwanzi mwinjà gwarhenga emahanga, kwo guli nka mîshi abà mumiro gw’omuntu oli nyôrha.<verse eid="PRO 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 25:26"/>Omushinganyanya oyôbohire enkola-maligo, ye muguma n’iriba lilabarhanyè nîsi erhi nshôko bahemwîre.<verse eid="PRO 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 25:27"/>Okulya obûci bunji kurhabà kwinjà, okurhebwa n’ebinwa by’oluhohòlolo nakwo kurhabà kwinjà.<verse eid="PRO 25:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 25:28"/>Olugo lw’omwerûlè, lulya lurhalikwo côgo, lwo lugumà n’omuntu orhajira murhima.<verse eid="PRO 25:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PRO 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuhwinja burhabukwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 26:1"/>Oku ecânda cishuhwa n’enkuba y’olubula erhi nkuba kwône, kwo n’omusirhe ashuhwa n’olukengwa.<verse eid="PRO 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 26:2"/>Kula akafûnzi kaburuduka, na kulîra ehiremberembe hiheneka, kwo n’enfûlago y’obumâma egenda ciru.<verse eid="PRO 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 26:3"/>Nka kula bayîkira eciterusi akarhi, n’ecihêsi omukoba kwo banabikira abahwinja emihini.<verse eid="PRO 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 26:4"/>Orhahîra okadumiza omusirhe oku isirhc lyâge, wakanabà akâge nâwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 26:5"/>Omusirhe omushuze nk’oku isirhc lyâge linali, akâmanya mpu ali murhimanya.<verse eid="PRO 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 26:6"/>Kubula-bulà na kucîtwa amaboko, okurhuma omuganda w’ecingolo-ngolo.<verse eid="PRO 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 26:7"/>Entege z’ow’akagulu zirhajira nsimiko, zo nguma n’omugani omu kanwa k’ecingolo-ngolo.<verse eid="PRO 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 26:8"/>Kunanîriza ibuye oku mujaleti, okuhà ecingolo-ngolo irenge.<verse eid="PRO 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 26:9"/>Omugani omu kanwa k’ecingolo-ngolo, ihaji lya kashûgi-shûgi omu nfune z’omulalwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 26:10"/>Omulwî wâlasha ngasi muntu wacîgerera, ye muguma n’omuntu oziga akolerwa n’ecingolo-ngolo.<verse eid="PRO 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 26:11"/>Kulîra akabwa kashubîrira ebishaliza, kwo n’omuhwinja naye ashubirira obuhwinja bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 26:12"/>K’okola oshanzire omuntu ôcibwîne burhimanya? Omusirhe ye mukulu hali ye.<verse eid="PRO 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 26:13"/>Omwôlo erhi engoromora eri emuhanda, «entale eri emuhanda!»<verse eid="PRO 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 26:14"/>Omwôlo kwo ahinduluka aha ncîngo, kula olumvi luhinduluka omu mulirango.<verse eid="PRO 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 26:15"/>Omwôlo anazinde alikira okuboko oku cishanjo, okukuyêrekeza ekanwa kumurhamye.<verse eid="PRO 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 26:16"/>Omwôlo kw’amanya mpu ye murhimanya olushîne, walusha bantu nda bashuza n’obwîrhonzi.<verse eid="PRO 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 26:17"/>Okucîhira omu lubanja lwa bene, kubà kugwârha amarhwîri g’akabwa.<verse eid="PRO 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 26:18"/>Kwo ali ak’omusirhe walasha omuherho gulikwo emyampi èkolîre, gulikwo n’empiru n’olufù,<verse eid="PRO 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 26:19"/>omuntu orheba owâbo, abuliderha, erhi: «byàli bihinza!»<verse eid="PRO 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 26:20"/>Cibula ca nshâli cizimya omuliro entambala nayo enahwe nka ntà rukozo-wâkoza.<verse eid="PRO 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 26:21"/>Omuntu mukunizi kw’azûsa akadali kulîra, amakala gazûsa omuliro, kulîra bahira enshâli oku cîko.<verse eid="PRO 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 26:22"/>Ebinwa by’omuntu w’omwanzi bubà bununîrizi, buyandagalira omu nda kuhika oku nyômvu.<verse eid="PRO 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 26:23"/>Buhomo oku nyungu y’ibûmba, ko kanwa k’omuntu oganira n’olubohôlolo, n’obwo omurhima gwâge guli mubî.<verse eid="PRO 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 26:24"/>Oshombana ajira oku arhebana n’ebinwa, n’obwo omurhima gwâge guyûbarhîre obulyâlya;<verse eid="PRO 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 26:25"/>ciru akaderha n’obwonjo, orhamuyêmêraga, bulyâla omu murhima gwâge muli bigalu-galu nda.<verse eid="PRO 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 26:26"/>Enshômbo hali amango ecihundikira obulenga, omu ndêko mwo eciyêrekanira.<verse eid="PRO 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 26:27"/>Ohûmba omwîna anagugwemwo, ohirika ibuye linamugalukekwo.<verse eid="PRO 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 26:28"/>Olulimi lunywesi lushomba okuli, akanwa kashigîriza kushâba kashâba.<verse eid="PRO 26:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PRO 27"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 27:1"/>Orhacîkubagiraga omulegerege gw’irhôndo, bulya orhamanyiri bici byarhenga mw’ogu gw’ene.<verse eid="PRO 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 27:2"/>Wundi wâkukûnga ci arhali kanwa kâwe wêne, muntu wârhenga kuli ci arhali wêne.<verse eid="PRO 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 27:3"/>ibuye lizidoha n’omushenyi kwo na kwo, ci omungo omusirhe alêrhera omuntu gucilushire.<verse eid="PRO 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 27:4"/>Omutula gubâ mumînya, n’obukali gubâ muhûsi, omungo gw’owamânyagwa gwohe ndi wankagulîndira?<verse eid="PRO 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 27:5"/>Aha wankasîmwa n’orhaderha, wankakalihirwa n’owakubwîririra.<verse eid="PRO 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 27:6"/>Omwîra anakulubira obone n’oku alubire, ci omwanzi anakuhôbera erhi anakuhigîre.<verse eid="PRO 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 27:7"/>Mumiro guyigusire anagalule obûci, mumiro gushalisire ananunirwe n’ebilulu.<verse eid="PRO 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 27:8"/>Omuntu ogenda-genda ahike kulî n’ecihugo aburhagwamwo, kwo ali nka akanyunyi kayâbukira kuli n’olwôgo lwâko.<verse eid="PRO 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 27:9"/>Amavurha gabaya bwinjà kushagalusa gashagalusa omurhima, nakwo okujira omwîra nkana kunabombêze omurhima.<verse eid="PRO 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 27:10"/>Orhahîra okalekêrera omwîra wâwe nîsi erhi omwîra wa sho, orhahîra okajà aha mwa bene winyu olusiku oli burhè. Mwîra oli hôfi, ye mukulu hali muci wa muntu oli kuli.<verse eid="PRO 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 27:11"/>Mwâna wâni, hinduka murhimanya lyo oshagalusa omurhima gwâni, lyo mmanya oku nâshuza ngasi abangayisize.<verse eid="PRO 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 27:12"/>Omwenge akabona obuhanya anacîfulike, omuhwinja yêhe mpu abugeraho acîyandûlire!<verse eid="PRO 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 27:13"/>Omunyâge ecirondo, bulyâla acîhânyire ncungulà oku w’ihanga, na kuli oyu orhamanyiri omuhûnekwoye ecikinja.<verse eid="PRO 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 27:14"/>Omuntu wagisha owâbo n’izù linene sêzi-sêzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abayahudi bâli hanzibwe okulamusanya n’omuntu arhacijira omusengero gw’esêzi: sinza Ebibliya y’e Yeruzalemu.</char></note>, abandi banamugânjire omu balozi!<verse eid="PRO 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 27:15"/>Omukazi w’embaka ye muguma na kula obona emirhônyi, era mirhônyi ehona oku nyumpa burhahusa olusiku lw’omudûmbi.<verse eid="PRO 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 27:16"/>Ogwêrhe owa bene oyo erhi mpûsi agwêrhe, n’okuboko kwâge kulyo mavurha kufumbasire.<verse eid="PRO 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 27:17"/>Cûma cirhyaza ecûma, muntu oyengehya owâbo.<verse eid="PRO 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 27:18"/>Olanga emizêti ye nayirya amalehe. olanga nnawâbo ye najà irenge.<verse eid="PRO 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 27:19"/>Kulîra obusù burhashusha bwâbo, kwo n’emirhima y’abantu erhashushana.<verse eid="PRO 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 27:20"/>Wa-nyênga na Wa-kuzimu, abo bombi barhîgurha. kwo n’amasù gw’omuntu garhîgurha.<verse eid="PRO 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 27:21"/>Hali ecibeye c’amarhale hali n’eca amasholo: Omuntu yêne okwânîne ayirukire ayumva ebinwa by’okulimîrhiza.<verse eid="PRO 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 27:22"/>Omusirhe ciru wankamushakulira omu cishakulo; isirhe lyâge lirhankamurhengakwo.<verse eid="PRO 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 27:23"/>Omanye ebintu byâwe bwinjà, obusò bwâwe obushîbirire;<verse eid="PRO 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 27:24"/>bulyâla obugale burhabâ bw’ensiku n’amango, obuhirhi burhasigirwa iburha n’erindi.<verse eid="PRO 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 27:25"/>Ôbà wamâkolôla, n’oburheme bwamâvunda. wamânasingula ebyâsi by’oku ntondo,<verse eid="PRO 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 27:26"/>obè n’abâna-buzi ly’obona eci wâyambala, obè na bihebe nka binga wakatwamwo olubanja lwamashwa gâwe;<verse eid="PRO 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 27:27"/>obè na marhà manji ga mpene, bibè bijumbu kuli we, oku ba aha mwâwe na kuli bambali-kazi bâwe.<verse eid="PRO 27:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PRO 28"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 28:1"/>Omumînya anayâke na ntâye omulibisirekwo; omushinganyanya yêhe kwo abâ adekerîre nka mwâna wa ntale.<verse eid="PRO 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 28:2"/>Bubî bwa ba-ciri-misî butula entambala, omurhimanya ayifûnge.<verse eid="PRO 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 28:3"/>Omumînya wâlibuza omuhanya, ye muguma n’enkuba yâshereza emyâka, olônze eciribwa, ocibule!<verse eid="PRO 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 28:4"/>Omuntu okulekerera irhegeko: kuyinjibana enkola-maligo, ci omuntu oshimba irhegeko, arhabona oku nkola-maligo.<verse eid="PRO 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 28:5"/>Enkola-maligo zirhumva hishingânîne, abalonza Nyakasane bôhe byoshi bayumva.<verse eid="PRO 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 28:6"/>Owabâ ali mukenyi nka anali mudahemuka, ye mukulu oku muntu w’enjira z’ebinzongo-nzongo ciru akabà mugale.<verse eid="PRO 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 28:7"/>Oshimba irhegeko ye mwâna mwenge, okômera enkonola-masù anabonêsa bene îshe nshonyi.<verse eid="PRO 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 28:8"/>Omuntu ogala n’eby’obungunganya n’oyungukira oku bandi, analundikire abâyishibigabira abakenyi.<verse eid="PRO 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 28:9"/>Omuntu ocîfuka amarhwîri mpu bankanamukengêza amarhegeko omusengero gwâge gurhahika.<verse eid="PRO 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 28:10"/>Omuntu ohabulira obushinganyanya omu njira mbî, arhakabula bugwa omu mwîna ahûmbaga yêne.<verse eid="PRO 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 28:11"/>Omugale kwo aderha mpu ali murhimanya, n’obwo omuganda w’amakengu anamuyenje anamugwâse.<verse eid="PRO 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 28:12"/>Abashinganyanya bakayaza ntâye orhasima, endyâlya zikaja eruhya abagula banayôngoloke muguma-muguma.<verse eid="PRO 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 28:13"/>Omuntu ofulika amabî gâge kuyabirwa anayabirwa, ci omuntu ocîshobeka akanagaleka kubabalirwa anababalirwa,<verse eid="PRO 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 28:14"/>Iragi lyâge omuntu oyôrha akomekîre, ci kwône omuntu w’omurhima muzibu nk’ibuye, kuhanyagala anahanyagala.<verse eid="PRO 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 28:15"/>Kw’ali nka ntale yalûmba, nka ciryanyi ciri ishali, omuntu obîhira olubaga.<verse eid="PRO 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 28:16"/>Omuluzi akabula bwâge bwenge ly’anyagana, oshomba eby’obuhagwe ye rihya ensiku.<verse eid="PRO 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 28:17"/>Oyu balibirhakwo mpu ayîsire omuntu, ânalinde ahika aha nshinda erhi kuyâka ayâka, orhahîra okamuhumakwo.<verse eid="PRO 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 28:18"/>Omuntu ojira obwôrhere bushingânîne ârhakabà kurhi, ci omuntu odûngira eyi n’eyi: arhabula olunda arhogîre!<verse eid="PRO 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 28:19"/>Omuntu ohinga ishwa lyâge ye nabona ecijumbu ayikula, n’olibirha oku mpûsi ye yîgurha ecizômbo.<verse eid="PRO 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 28:20"/>Orhabêsha ye banabûmba mugisho, olonza okugala duba arhabula butumula.<verse eid="PRO 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 28:21"/>Kurhabà kwinjà okujira akanânâ, ci kwône ehihimbi hy’ecijumbu hinarhume omuntu alyâlyanya.<verse eid="PRO 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 28:22"/>Owa amagene anabishwire, ahabe oku olusiku lw’ecizômbo luciri nyuma.<verse eid="PRO 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 28:23"/>Okalihira omuntu anazinde erhi arhona, kulusha ow’akalimi kalimîrhiza.<verse eid="PRO 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 28:24"/>Ozimba îshe na nnina mpu «cirhali câha» erhi alingiyinjibana ebishambo.<verse eid="PRO 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 28:25"/>Mwonganwa otula entambala, oyêgemera Nyakasane arhakabona itâka.<verse eid="PRO 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 28:26"/>Ocîkubagira obwenge bwâge yênene erhi muhwinja, omuntu ogenda acîrhonzire arhabâ kurhi.<verse eid="PRO 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 28:27"/>Omuntu ohà abakenyi arhashalika, ci kwône ogenda azibire erhi mujâcire.<verse eid="PRO 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 28:28"/>Endyâlya zikayimuka, abantu banacîfulike ci kwône zikaherêrekera, abashinganyanya banaluge.<verse eid="PRO 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PRO 29"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 29:1"/>Omuntu oyumva bamukalihira acîkenyegule, kukenyuka anakenyuka burhalûnga.<verse eid="PRO 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 29:2"/>Nka barhimanya barhegeka, olugaga lunayumve lusîmire, nka ndyâlya ziri oku ntebe, olubaga kulaka lulaka.<verse eid="PRO 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 29:3"/>Omuntu orhonya oburhimanya ye simîsa îshe, orhonya abakazi b’ebishungu, kusherêza anasherêza e birugu byâge.<verse eid="PRO 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 29:4"/>Bushinganyanya mwâmi ayôlolosamwo ecihugo, ow’obuhagwe yêhe kusherêza acîsherêza.<verse eid="PRO 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 29:5"/>Olimîrhiza owundi, erhi murhego mulabarhe amufulisire.<verse eid="PRO 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 29:6"/>Endyâlya enalambagire erhi enali ntege, omushinganyanya yêhe âgenda ashagalusire.<verse eid="PRO 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 29:7"/>Omushinganyanya anakaziyumva olubanja lw’abakenyi, endyâlya erhishi-luyumvîrhiza.<verse eid="PRO 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 29:8"/>Abagambanyi banayôce ekà, ci abagula bôhe aha bali kufûnga bafûnga entambala.<verse eid="PRO 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 29:9"/>Omugula wajîsa omusirhe kadali, anakaliha erhi ashese ci erhi anayâzire.<verse eid="PRO 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 29:10"/>Ebishungu birhabona oku mushinganyanya, abashinganyanya bôhe kugendêrera bagendêrera obuzîne bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 29:11"/>Muhwinja oziga omutula gwamurhaluka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omutula gunarhaluke omuntu, nka kula amamvu gazônga omuntu. Kwo n’oburhè nabo bunaderheza omuntu ebigalu-galu. </char></note>, omurhimanya yêhe anagurhûlirize.<verse eid="PRO 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 29:12"/>Omurhambo okâyumvirhiza ngasi binwa bya bunywesi, abambali boshi oku banali barhabonekemwo orhali mubî.<verse eid="PRO 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 29:13"/>Omuganda n’omugale babugânîne muli oku: bombi Nyakasane obamolekera mûshi.<verse eid="PRO 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 29:14"/>Omwâmi otwîra abagûnda olubanja n’abushinganyanya. entebe yâge kusera yânayôrhe esêra.<verse eid="PRO 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 29:15"/>Okushûrhwa n’okukalihirwa binahe omuntu oburhimanya omwâna balekêrera ye bonesa nnina nshonyi.<verse eid="PRO 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 29:16"/>Nka nkola-maligo ziri oku ntebe ly’obubî buluga, ci kwône abashinganyanya banayishibona oku zahunguluka.<verse eid="PRO 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 29:17"/>Okazihanûla mugala wâwe, wâbona oku acikushagalusa, anarhume omurhima gwâwe gwarhîmûkwa.<verse eid="PRO 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 29:18"/>Nka ntà mulêbi, olubaga lunabè nka kulya balunika, yêhe w’iragi omuntu oshimba irhegeko.<verse eid="PRO 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 29:19"/>Omujà arhadundwa na binwa, anabè abiyumvîrhe arhânabishimbè.<verse eid="PRO 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 29:20"/>K’obwîne ola muntu ohamira oku binwa? Omusirhe ye mukulu hali ye.<verse eid="PRO 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 29:21"/>Orhogoza omujà ociri murhò, erhi akula anamukulire.<verse eid="PRO 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 29:22"/>Omuntu oluba duba ntambala atula; n’omukali arhahwa arhâlogorha!<verse eid="PRO 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 29:23"/>Okugayana kunarhume omuntu ashuba nyamakobwa, n’omuntu acîrhôhya ye najà irenge.<verse eid="PRO 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 29:24"/>Kunali kulukira haguma n’ecishambo, na kucîhanyagaza, okuyumva bakûngulira oyu burhalikwo, okanahulika.<verse eid="PRO 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 29:25"/>Oyôboha abantu arhimangigwa omu murhego, ocîkubagira Nyakasane agwêrhe ah’agwêrhe.<verse eid="PRO 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 29:26"/>Banji balwîra okurhona emunda omurhambo ali, ci kwône Nyakasane yêne ohà omuntu olubanja.<verse eid="PRO 29:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 29:27"/>Abashinganyanya barhakwirirwa nkola-maligo, n’enkola-maligo erhabona oku muntu mushinganyanya.<verse eid="PRO 29:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PRO 30"/>
  <para style="ms1">VI. Ebinwa bya Aguri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 30:1"/>Ebinwa bya Aguri, mwene Yâkehe w’è Masi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:1">Alaga ebinwa oyo muntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">30, 1: Ebinwa by’ecihabraniya biri aha, abalenga barhabiyumva kuguma boshi.</char></note> àrhumiraga Itiyeli, kuli Itiyeli bona Ukala.<verse eid="PRO 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 30:2"/>Ntà muhwinja akâni omu bantu, ntajira makengu ga muntu,<verse eid="PRO 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 30:3"/>Oburhimanya ntabuyigaga, n’obumanye bw’abimâna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">30, 3: Kwo kuderha obumanye omwimâna yêne ayigîriza. Bukenge burhumire bamuderha nka hanji. ntabuyishi.</char></note><verse eid="PRO 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 30:4"/>Ndi okola osôkîre emalunga anabuligaluka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:4">Ndi okola ofumbasire empûsi omu nfune zâge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:4">Ndi okola obohire amîshi omu cirondo câge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:4">Ndi watwâga embibi z’igulu zoshi? K’oyishi izîno lyâge?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:4">K’oyishi izîno ly’omugala?<verse eid="PRO 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 30:5"/>Ngasi luderho lwa Nyamuzinda lubà lucesîbwe n’omuliro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:5">abâ mpenzi y’oyegemire muli ye.<verse eid="PRO 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 30:6"/>Akanwa kâge orhahîra okakahebakwo akandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:6">wankanatumula bakujire munywesi.<verse eid="PRO 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omusengero</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 30:7"/>Bibirhi nkusêngîre, orhabinyimaga, obinshobôze ntacifà:<verse eid="PRO 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 30:8"/>Oncînge oku bunywesi n’oku bulênzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:8">orhampâga bukenyi orhampâga na bugale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:8">ci ondeke nâni ndye oku mugati<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Vulgata: «casinga ompè eci nalya», </char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 30:9"/>Kuderha nti nakayigurha obone namâkuhaba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:9">obone nkola naderha nti: Nyamuzinda ye ndi oyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:9">nîsi erhi nshalike obone nkola nazimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:9">obone namâhemukira izîno lya Nyamubâho.<verse eid="PRO 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 30:10"/>Orhahîraga okashobeka omujà emunda nnabamwâbo ali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:10">ankanakuhehêrera ohanyagale.<verse eid="PRO 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">VII. Emigani erimwo emibalè</para>
  <para style="s1">Enyumpa mbî ziri inni, n’ebirhayumvîkana ho biri</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 30:11"/>Hali obûko, oku bàjacira îshe, kwo na nnina barhamukenziri.<verse eid="PRO 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 30:12"/>Hali obûko bumanya mpu buli bwa bêru-kwêru, n’obwo izinga lyâbo libananîrekwo.<verse eid="PRO 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 30:13"/>Hali obûko bulolera abandi oku cikanyi, n’ebisike biyunjwire kagayo.<verse eid="PRO 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 30:14"/>Hali obûko bujira engôrho mpu mîno, n’orhwere mpu myanganga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:14">rhwo bashanyangulamwo abagûnda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:14">babarhenze hano igulu, banasigise abakenyi abâbo bantu.<verse eid="PRO 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hali binni birhîgurha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 30:15"/>Omushundwe gujira banyere babirhi: bo ba lêrha! lêrha!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:15">Hali bisharhu birhîgurha na binni birhaderha mpu: «lekaga»!<verse eid="PRO 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 30:16"/>Okuzimu, endâ y’engûmba, idaho lirhigurha mîshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:16">n’omuliro gurhaderha mpu: lekaga!<verse eid="PRO 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 30:17"/>Amasù omuntu akengulamwo îshe, âgagayira nnina wa muntu obugikulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:17">bihungu by’oku lwîshi byâgarhule, bigukuma byâgashêge!<verse eid="PRO 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 30:18"/>Hali bisharhu nyumva bintalusire, na binni ntishi:<verse eid="PRO 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 30:19"/>enjira ya lubaka emalunga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:19">enjira y’enjoka oku mbyâ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:19">enjira y’obwârho omu karhî k’enyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:19">enjira y’omulume omu mwanahyâ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu mwâna-hya: mukazi wa muhya, arhali kuhaba obulyo bw’okumuhima, ci ihwe ly’ukubà izîmi n’okuburha!</char></note>,<verse eid="PRO 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 30:20"/>Enjira y’omukazi w’ecishungu yoshi eyo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:20">anabà amâlya ahôrhole nakanwa, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:20">«ntà bubî najizire».<verse eid="PRO 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 30:21"/>Hali bisharhu bigeza igulu mw’omusisi: na binni birhalindwa:<verse eid="PRO 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 30:22"/>omujà wamâhinduka mwâmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:22">n’omusirhe wamagala,<verse eid="PRO 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 30:23"/>Omunyere bàkazâgibenga wamâheruka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:23">n’omujà-nyere wamâyîmûla nn’omumwâbo!<verse eid="PRO 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebinyinyî nabyo hibà binni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 30:24"/>Hano igulu habâ binyinyi binni: cikwône barhimanya omu barhimanya.<verse eid="PRO 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 30:25"/>Obunyegere, lubà lubaga lwa butya-butya, ci kwône buyishi oku bahaka enguli canda.<verse eid="PRO 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 30:26"/>Ebishegeshe, ebà ngabo ya mbula-misî, ci kwône biyishiyûbaka omu mabâle.<verse eid="PRO 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 30:27"/>Enzige, zirhajira murhambo, ci kwône bwinjà zihinda.<verse eid="PRO 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 30:28"/>Omusherebera, nfune egugwârha, cikwône omu bwâmi guyâlukiza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nka kula baderha eno mwîrhu Bushi, mpu: omuntu anashombe nyalugâka babul’iyalukiza nyumpa nguma.</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayishikânânda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 30:29"/>Hali basharhu bayishicûka, na bani bayishikânanda.<verse eid="PRO 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 30:30"/>Wa-ntale, ntwâli omu by’erubala, arhayôboha bici!<verse eid="PRO 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 30:31"/>Nyaluhazè wakânanda omu karhî k’engoko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:31">n’ecihebe cayâbula obusò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:31">na mwâmi omu ngabo yâge.<verse eid="PRO 30:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 30:32"/>Erhi wankahabuka okakaliha, n’erhi wakabà wacîjîre emurhima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:32">onahire enfune oku kanwa!<verse eid="PRO 30:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 30:33"/>Bulyâla, amarhà, omuntu akagatûnda, ganarhengemwo amakâfè;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:33">izulu, omuntu akalisinaga bwenêne, linarhengemwo omukò,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 30:33">n’oburhè, okubunanîriza kunarhengemwo entambala.<verse eid="PRO 30:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PRO 31"/>
  <para style="ms1">VIII. Ebinwa bya Lemuweli</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 31:1"/>Ebinwa bya Lemuweli mwâmi w’e Masa, nnina wamubwîrizagyabyo.<verse eid="PRO 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 31:2"/>Mâshi mwâna wâni, mâshi k’omu nda! Mâshi busîngo busînga omuliro!<verse eid="PRO 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 31:3"/>Irhondo orhahîraga okarhega abakazi emisî yâwe, orhahîraga okacirhega ba-kaheza-k’abâmi.<verse eid="PRO 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 31:4"/>Kurhahimwa kushuha abâmi, Lemuweli, kurhahimwa okushuha abâmi okucirhega amamvu, ciru n’oku baluzi okurhonya enzoga kurhabâ kwo!<verse eid="PRO 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 31:5"/>Kuderha mpu okunywa kwankanabayibagiza olushika bàtwaga bône, obone bamâlenganya abarhindibuzîbwe.<verse eid="PRO 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 31:6"/>Amamvu makali onagahe omuhera, idivayi onalihè ogwêrhwe n’omutula,<verse eid="PRO 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 31:7"/>anywe, ayibagire obuhanya bumulikwo; anywe arhacikengêraga bulya bulagîrire bwâge.<verse eid="PRO 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 31:8"/>Okazibumbûla akanwa oderhere akaduma, oderhere n’enfûzi;<verse eid="PRO 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 31:9"/>Okazibumbûla akanwa otwe olubanja bwinjà;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 31:9">omukenyi n’àbarhindibuzîbwe, okazibatwira olubanja.<verse eid="PRO 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">IX. Irenge ly’omukazi nkana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 31:10"/>Omukazi nkana ndi wankamubona? Agwêrhe ecitwîro cilushire ec’amagerha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Er’irenge ly’omukazi nkana (murhim’ali ekà) luli lwîganyo lw’oburhimanya bw’omuntu</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 31:11"/>Omurhima gw’ibà ye gubà gucîkubagire, na ntâkwo abule buyunguka omugwêrhe.<verse eid="PRO 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 31:12"/>Ensiku zoshi z’obuzîne bwâge, kuciza amuciza, ci arhamulibuza.<verse eid="PRO 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 31:13"/>Anajè aho alonze obwôya bw’ecibuzi n’ecitâni, ahirekwo n’obulenga bw’amaboko gâge.<verse eid="PRO 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 31:14"/>Kw’abâ nka bwârho bwa murhunzi, bwo buged’ishundira kuli<verse eid="PRO 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 31:15"/>Azuka buciri budufu, ayîkuze ab’aha kâ, agabire n’abambalikazi omukolo.<verse eid="PRO 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 31:16"/>Akalonza ishwa analibone; bunguke bw’omu maboko gâge arhwêresamwo emizâbîbu.<verse eid="PRO 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 31:17"/>Omushângi buzibu agukobeka, n’emisî ya amaboko gâge kukolêsa ayikolêsa.<verse eid="PRO 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 31:18"/>Anakaziba ayumvîrhe oku obushanja bwâge buli bwinjà, na budufu akamole kâge karhazima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anayumve asîmire omukolo gwâge bulya gumubêrîre. Okuderha; mpu: «itara lyâge lirhazima budufu, arhali mpu oku cîko alâla, nanga, ci mpu enyumpa yâge ecîkenzire, bulya mîra emwa Abayahudi, enyumpa ecikenzire erhazimagamwo muliro, muliro gw’oku itara, n’okuzima kwâgo erhi mishîbo, kandi erhi bundi buhanya» (sinza <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 18:6">Ayu 18, 6</ref></char>).</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 31:19"/>Okuboko anakulîkire oku bushanja, n’eminwe yâge ebungûle omugozi.<verse eid="PRO 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 31:20"/>Anabumbûlire omukenyi enfune, alambûlire n’omuganda okuboko.<verse eid="PRO 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 31:21"/>Arhayôbohera enyumpa yâge oku nkuba y’olubula, bulyâla ab’omu mwâge boshi, ntà wa mushângi muguma.<verse eid="PRO 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 31:22"/>Amalengeti gâge yêne ogaluka, omushângi gwâge gw’akaduku n’ecitâni.<verse eid="PRO 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 31:23"/>Aha ngombe ibà agwerheho olukengwa, ho atamala aha karhî k’abagula b’ecihugo.<verse eid="PRO 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 31:24"/>Nyâmà wâni anakaziluka emishângi y’ecitâni aguza, n’omukaba agugulize omurhunzi.<verse eid="PRO 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 31:25"/>Obuzibu n’olukengwa gwo mwambalo gwâge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arhaganya buligo, arhanabulânga.</char></note>, âsheka ene, asheke n’irhondo.<verse eid="PRO 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 31:26"/>Anakazibumbûla akanwa n’oburhimanya, n’oku lulimi lwâge kanwa ka butûdu kakubâ.<verse eid="PRO 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 31:27"/>Arhahabiri enjira zirhenga omu mwâge n’ezimuja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayôsire ali masù ali na mushîbirizi, bakayigula olumvi aha mwâge arhahaba!</char></note>, arhanalya mugati gwa bwôlo.<verse eid="PRO 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 31:28"/>Abagala bayimanzire, mpu baderhe oku ali muny’iragi, ibà naye anakazimukunga.<verse eid="PRO 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 31:29"/>Abakazi bàkozire ebinja bali banji, ci kwône w’oyo ocibalushire boshi.<verse eid="PRO 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 31:30"/>Iranga kurhebana lirhebana, n’obwinjà bubà bwa busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 31:30">omukazi orhînya Nyakasane ye kwânîne okukengwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahâla «Septante», erhi LXX, kandi erhi Ebibliya y’omu cigereki, ko ahahindwîre, mpu: «omukazi murhimanya» ye wajà irenge; okurhînya Nyamuzinda ko kwankakakûngwa. «Ye murhimanya». Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 8:22">Mig 8, 22</ref>; <ref loc="SIR 8:2">Burh 8, 2</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="PRO 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 31:31"/>Mumuhè oku binjà by’omu mukolo gwâge</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PRO 31:31">n’aha ngombe, emirimo yâge ederhe irenge lyâge.<verse eid="PRO 31:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 31"/>
</usx>
